 part of the Olympos Beydaglari National Park and on the UNESCO Tentative List.'' -> ''Notable remains include Roman baths, Byzantine basilicas, and necropolises [1]. The site is part of the Olympos Beydaglari National Park and on the UNESCO Tentative List [2] [3].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:304595", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-001-001: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/00f522ff/Aerial_View_of_Olympus_(Lycia)_from_the_west.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/00f522ff/Beydağları Coastal National Park and Olympos ancient city 3.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:305805", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-001-001-rollback-rest-001: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/00f522ff/Beydağları Coastal National Park and Olympos ancient city 3.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/00f522ff/Aerial_View_of_Olympus_(Lycia)_from_the_west.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:306681", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-001: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/00f522ff/Aerial_View_of_Olympus_(Lycia)_from_the_west.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/00f522ff/Beydağları Coastal National Park and Olympos ancient city 3.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:355553", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-24_mechanical-site-type-merge-s001: site_type ''City'' -> ''City/town/settlement''"}]'::jsonb),
