lanes and joint fractures [1] [3]. Neither the Japanese Agency for Cultural Affairs nor Okinawa Prefecture recognises it as a cultural artifact [1] [2].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:304059", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04e_period-label-undated: period_name None -> ''Undated''"}]'::jsonb),
