aeologists have not been able to date the tumulus precisely, but assume it was used during the Bronze Age [1]. According to local legends, the Dubberworth was made by a giant who intended to fill a narrow ford linking two nearby Bodden and lost the clay on their way [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:92389", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s001: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:92390", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s001: period_start ''-4500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:141945", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-001: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/01704ebd/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/01704ebd/Dobberworth 2016 03.jpg1.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:245557", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s001: period_name None -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:245558", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s001: period_start None -> ''-4000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:304604", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-001-001: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/01704ebd/Dobberworth 2016 03.jpg1.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/01704ebd/Dobberworth_2016_02.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:305814", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-001-001-rollback-rest-001: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/01704ebd/Dobberworth_2016_02.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/01704ebd/Dobberworth 2016 03.jpg1.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:306690", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-001: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/01704ebd/Dobberworth 2016 03.jpg1.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/01704ebd/Dobberworth_2016_02.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:346222", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "