 in the chamber along with many animal bones [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:92491", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s001: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> ''3000 - 1500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:92492", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s001: period_start ''-4500'' -> ''-3000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:142039", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-001: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/0546f6ab/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/0546f6ab/Cuween Hill Chambered Cairn 01.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:304696", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-001-001: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/0546f6ab/Cuween Hill Chambered Cairn 01.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/0546f6ab/Cuween_Hill,_front_external_view,_2012_March.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:305906", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-001-001-rollback-rest-001: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/0546f6ab/Cuween_Hill,_front_external_view,_2012_March.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/0546f6ab/Cuween Hill Chambered Cairn 01.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:306782", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-001: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/0546f6ab/Cuween Hill Chambered Cairn 01.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/0546f6ab/Cuween_Hill,_front_external_view,_2012_March.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
