1]. On the tabletop itself are found the two oldest-known Aboriginal sites in Queensland: Nonda Rock and Ngarrabullgan Cave [1]. Here Aboriginal cultural deposits have been radiocarbon dated, and dated by optically stimulated luminescence, back to 40,000+ years ago [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:113483", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s001: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:113484", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s001: period_start ''-500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:113485", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s001: site_type ''Cave Structures'' -> ''Sacred site''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:142078", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-001: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/aa/Ngarrabullgin001.JPG'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/06a1c527/hero.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:245611", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s001: period_name None -> ''< 4500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:245612", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s001: period_start None -> ''-10000''"}]'::jsonb),
    ('06a44374-50d9-4bc1-b747-41fa09e28eee'::uuid, 'empire_count', '1', '0', 'card-stats-2026-11-05-rollback:06a44374-50d9-4bc1-b747-41fa09e28eee:empire_count', 'rollback of card-stats-2026-11-05: empire_count ''0'' restored on Ninamarca', '26656a4062c33ba2e892ae916e2bf59f', '[{"source": "api/cardgame/generator.py:site_card_stats", "url": "api/cardgame/generator.py", "quote": "empire_count = 1 from tag_site(-13.391531004440365, -71.62200877733473, period_start None)"}, {"source": "production export 21200f1e3f26a29a (2026-11-05 22:52:16.465314+00)", "url": "remediation_change_log + unified_sites + card_stats (read-only)", "quote": "counterfactual: 5519 journalled input value(s) put back reproduce the stored card_stats in all 59724 cells (basis: wave 2026-10-04f''s own export (2026-10-04 19:19:41.515456+00))"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:80628", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase4:p4-2002:chunk-0001: description ''Ninamarca is a pre-Inca archaeological site in the Cusco Region, located on a hill overlooking the Pucara Valley along the Cusco-Paucartambo highway. It contains approximately 30 chullpas (funerary towers), both cylindrical and rectangular, ranging from 1.25 to 8 metres in height, built by the Lupaca people using local stone without mortar. The towers served as elite burial structures where remains were placed in fetal positions with belongings, reflecting beliefs in an afterlife. Dating to the pre-Inca period (c. 1000-1400 AD), the site preserves evidence of Lupaca social hierarchy through the varying sizes of the structures.'' -> ''Ninamarca (possibly from Quechua nina fire, marka village, \"fire village\") is an archaeological site in Peru [1]. It is located in the Cusco Region, Paucartambo Province, Colquepata District, southeast of Colquepata near the village of Ninamaca [1]. There are about 30 chullpas of pre-Inca times situated on top of a mountain at about 3,000 m [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:92511", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s001: period_name ''1 - 500 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:92512", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s001: period_start ''1'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:142079", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-001: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5a/Ninamarca.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/06a44374/Sitio arqueológico Ninamarca 01.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:245613", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s001: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:245614", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s001: period_start None -> ''-800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:331376", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-006-001: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/06a44374/Sitio arqueológico Ninamarca 01.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/06a44374/Ninamarca.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:346262", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s001: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:346263", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s001: period_start ''-800'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
