d around 15,500 years ago [1]. The cave is located next to the Sasiola Quarry, which presents a threat to the conservation of the paintings [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:93237", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s002: period_name ''< 4500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:93238", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s002: period_start ''-13500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:142722", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-002: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/67/Praileaitz.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/0ae727b3/hero.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:245665", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s001: period_name None -> ''< 4500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:245666", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s001: period_start None -> ''-10000''"}]'::jsonb),
    ('0b15deb1-cfb6-4f85-ab6c-ef09ceef175f'::uuid, 'antiquity', '5', '6', 'card-stats-2026-11-05-rollback:0b15deb1-cfb6-4f85-ab6c-ef09ceef175f:antiquity', 'rollback of card-stats-2026-11-05: antiquity ''6'' restored on Sandy, Bedfordshire', 'db5286228fcfa1a303d90146fe8d1b26', '[{"source": "api/cardgame/generator.py:site_card_stats", "url": "api/cardgame/generator.py", "quote": "antiquity = 5 from period_start None"}, {"source": "production export 21200f1e3f26a29a (2026-11-05 22:52:16.465314+00)", "url": "remediation_change_log + unified_sites + card_stats (read-only)", "quote": "counterfactual: 5519 journalled input value(s) put back reproduce the stored card_stats in all 59724 cells (basis: wave 2026-10-04f''s own export (2026-10-04 19:19:41.515456+00))"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:93239", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s002: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:93240", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s002: period_start ''-1000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:142725", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-002: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ad/Sandy_market_square.jpg/400px-Sandy_market_square.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/0b15deb1/BigBossedSaxonPot.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:169132", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase4wc:p4wc-4204:chunk-0001: description \"Sandy was a significant Romano-British small town in Central Bedfordshire, situated at the junction of two major Roman roads. Recent excavations uncovered the first Roman town wall found in Bedfordshire, built from local ironstone and mortar, enclosing an area of about 11 hectares. The settlement supported pottery manufacture, iron working, and bronze working, functioning as a centre of trade and redistribution. A large cemetery at Tower Hill contained both cremation and inhumation burials, along with high-status finds including lead coffins, bronze bowls, and a rare oculist''s stamp. Evidence of Saxon occupation was also discovered outside the town walls.\" -> ''Sandy was a significant Romano-British small town in Central Bedfordshire [1] [2]. Recent excavations uncovered the first Roman town wall found in Bedfordshire, built from local ironstone and mortar, enclosing an area of about 11 hectares [1] [3]. A large cemetery at Tower Hill contained both cremation and inhumation burials [4]. Evidence of Saxon occupation was also discovered outside the town walls [3].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:245667", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s001: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:245668", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s001: period_start None -> ''-1500''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:346296", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s001: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:346297", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s001: period_start ''-1500'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
