tery of the northern Ubaid period type [1]. More than 300 samples of painted pottery covered with monochrome drawings were found [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:93278", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s002: period_name ''< 4500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:93279", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s002: period_start ''-5000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:93280", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s002: site_type ''City/town/settlement'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:234564", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s001: period_name None -> ''< 4500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:234565", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s001: period_start None -> ''-5000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:234566", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s001: site_type None -> ''Settlement''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:304804", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-001-001: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/0d4830b5/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/0d4830b5/Elikomektepe_saxsi_qab.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:306005", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-001-001-rollback-rest-001: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/0d4830b5/Elikomektepe_saxsi_qab.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/0d4830b5/hero.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:306890", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-001: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/0d4830b5/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/0d4830b5/Elikomektepe_saxsi_qab.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:355565", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-24_mechanical-site-type-merge-s001: site_type ''Settlement'' -> ''City/town/settlement''"}]'::jsonb),
