 were made by artist Ștefan [1]. In the 18th century more paintings were added by Simion de Pitești and his apprentices [1]. From 1566 to the end of the 19th century, the building functioned as a Calvinist church, too [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:93312", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s002: period_name ''1 - 500 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:93313", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s002: period_start ''1'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:142879", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-002: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/0eec5ffa/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/0eec5ffa/Biserica Densuș pe fundal de Sub Carpați Retezat.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:234581", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s001: period_name None -> ''1000 - 1500 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:234582", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s001: period_start None -> ''1250''"}]'::jsonb),
