 have been inhabited between 600-1050 CE [1]. A 1,000-year old Maya palace was discovered in Kulubá in 1939, by American archeologist Wyllys Andrews [1]. Kulubá consists of three main architectural structures [1]. They are believed to be residential sets of important lineages [1]. The site is about 6 kilometres in diameter and some 300 smaller structures had been discovered by 2009 [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:113565", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s001: period_name ''500 - 1000 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:113566", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s001: period_start ''500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:142884", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-002: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/0f1ec894/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/0f1ec894/Culubá 2.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:246059", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s002: period_name None -> ''500 - 1000 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:246060", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s002: period_start None -> ''500''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:304851", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-001-001: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/0f1ec894/Culubá 2.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/0f1ec894/Culuba2.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:306052", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-001-001-rollback-rest-001: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/0f1ec894/Culuba2.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/0f1ec894/Culubá 2.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:306937", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-001: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/0f1ec894/Culubá 2.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/0f1ec894/Culuba2.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:357067", "url": "remediation_change_lo