nerations of cultural transmission. A 2,000-year-old grinding stone with bogong moth residue is the world''s earliest confirmed evidence of insect food processing.\" -> ''Cloggs Cave is a limestone cave near Buchan, Victoria, on GunaiKurnai Country [1] [2].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:246067", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s002: period_name None -> ''500 BC - 1 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:246068", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s002: period_start None -> ''-500''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:346324", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s001: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:346325", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s001: period_start ''-500'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
