isers were found looted from their original context but then discarded for being too eroded to be worth selling on the illicit antiquities market [1]. In 679 AD, a daughter of Calakmul\\''s powerful Yuknoom Ch\\''een was given in marriage to a La Corona king [1]. In 721 AD, a daughter of the Calakmul king (Yuknoom Took\\'' K\\''awiil) was married off to a king of La Corona [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:93347", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s002: period_name ''500 - 1000 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:93348", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s002: period_start ''500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:93349", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s002: site_type ''Settlement'' -> ''City''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:143358", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-003: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/1010b3bf/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/1010b3bf/La_Corona_relieve.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:234596", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s001: period_name None -> ''1 - 500 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:234597", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s001: period_start None -> ''250''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:321046", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-004-001: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/1010b3bf/La_Corona_relieve.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/1010b3bf/hero.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:324951", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-005-001: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/1010b3bf/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/1010b3bf/La Corona Relieve Juego de Pelota.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:355569", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-24_mechanical-site-type-merge-s001: site_typ