ning \"storm\\''s sting,\" reflecting winds up to 119 km/h. Recognized as a national heritage site by Iran in 2002, the windmills face an uncertain future as younger generations show little interest in their demanding upkeep.'' -> ''The name Nashtifan derives from words meaning \"storm\\''s sting,\" [1]. Recognized as a national heritage site by Iran in 2002, the windmills face an uncertain future as younger generations show little interest in their demanding upkeep [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:234629", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s001: site_type None -> ''Heritage site''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:246093", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s002: period_name None -> ''1 - 500 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:246094", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s002: period_start None -> ''1''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:338969", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "insert-2026-10-07-001-001: thumbnail_url None -> ''/data/images/wiki/138007c5/Nashtifan Windmills.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:346346", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s001: period_name ''1 - 500 AD'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:346347", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s001: period_start ''1'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
