arstification of the limestone Upper Jurassic Massif [1]. The first formal archaeological excavation was carried out in 1955 by a team led by Hipólito Cabaço [1]. This identified a communal funeral space, and radiocarbon dating of one individual''s bones indicates that the use of the cave as a necropolis dates back to between 3095 BC and 2915 BC [1]. Archaeologists also collected a number of objects, such as bone drills, beads of various materials, flint arrowheads, microliths, a polished stone axe, fragments of pottery and a bone figurine of a rabbit [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:93416", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s002: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:93417", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s002: period_start ''-4000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:143414", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-003: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/14c408ee/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/14c408ee/PedraFurada2.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:234632", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s001: period_name None -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:234633", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s001: period_start None -> ''-3095''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:321064", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-004-001: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/14c408ee/PedraFurada2.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/14c408ee/hero.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:324954", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-005-001: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/14c408ee/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/14c408ee/PedraFurada1.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
