y chance in 1954 by its owner, Roger Constant [1]. Apart from a Neanderthal skeleton discovered in 1957, excavator Eugène Bonifay found a large number of brown bear bones, several pits and stone platforms that contained bear bones [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:93435", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s002: period_name ''< 4500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:93436", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s002: period_start ''-68000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:143428", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-003: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/159db30a/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/159db30a/Regourdou_1.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:246109", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s002: period_name None -> ''500 BC - 1 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:246110", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s002: period_start None -> ''-500''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:346356", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s001: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> ''< 4500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:346357", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s001: period_start ''-500'' -> ''-68050''"}]'::jsonb),
