emediation_change_log:143429", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-003: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/15bc0443/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/15bc0443/Damcılı bulağı.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:307638", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-002: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/15bc0443/Damcılı bulağı.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/15bc0443/Çaxmaqdaşı_və_dəvəgözündən_mikrolitlər,_Damcılı_mağarası.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
