ness gear, jewelry, and clothing accessories characteristic of knights of Dacian and Scordisci origin [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:113625", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s001: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:113626", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s001: period_start ''-500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:113627", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s001: site_type ''Archaeological site'' -> ''Fort''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:113628", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s001: source_url ''https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Juhor'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:234654", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s001: source_url None -> ''https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Juhor''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:246137", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s002: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:246138", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s002: period_start None -> ''-800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:346379", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s001: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:346380", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s001: period_start ''-800'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:346381", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s001: source_url ''https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Juhor'' -> ''https://www.turistickiklub.com/sadrzaj/veliki-vetren''"}]'::jsonb),
