l superstructure [1] [2]. Originally a monumental tomb, possibly for consul M. Calpurnius Rufus [3]. Later repurposed as a lighthouse [1] [4]. Excavations since 2020 uncovered a column-lined Roman road extending toward Hadrian''s Gate, a dolphin-figured mosaic, and ancient bathhouse remains [5] [6].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:307710", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-002: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/197ce800/Antalya - Hidirlik Tower.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/197ce800/Hıdırlık_Tower_01.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
