he Tomb of Eve in Jeddah, and so does Ibn Khallikan (13th century) [1]. Aun Ar-Rafiq (Amir in Hijaz 1882–1905) tried to demolish the tomb, but that caused a public outcry [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:94389", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s003: period_name ''1 - 500 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:94390", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s003: period_start ''1'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:143931", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-004: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/80/Eves-tomb-the-story-of-a-pilgrimage-to-hijaz.png'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/1a2c2dc7/Tomb of Eve - topview.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:246475", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s003: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:246476", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s003: period_start None -> ''-800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:307725", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-002: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/1a2c2dc7/Tomb of Eve - topview.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/1a2c2dc7/Eves-tomb-the-story-of-a-pilgrimage-to-hijaz.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:346394", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s001: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:346395", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s001: period_start ''-800'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
