, were identified as belonging to haplogroup L1a [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:144543", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-005: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/1ef25b31/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/1ef25b31/Areni-1_cave_entrance.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
