estern margin of the Ribeira do Carapito [1]. Carapito I is the type of megalithic dolmen characterised by I. Moita as a simple structure with a ten-sided polygonal chamber without a corridor [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:94518", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s003: period_name ''3000 - 1500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:94519", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s003: period_start ''-3000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:235575", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s002: period_name None -> ''3000 - 1500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:235576", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s002: period_start None -> ''-2900''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:324967", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-005-001: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/1ff140bb/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/1ff140bb/Dólmen I de Carapito.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:347177", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s002: period_name ''3000 - 1500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:347178", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s002: period_start ''-2900'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:354763", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-19r_fields-wd5-s001: period_name ''Undated'' -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:354764", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-19r_fields-wd5-s001: period_start None -> ''-3998''"}]'::jsonb),
