t site located 13 km northwest of Yambol in southeastern Bulgaria, dating to the 6th and early 5th millennia BC [1] [2] [3].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:246881", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s004: period_name None -> ''500 BC - 1 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:246882", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s004: period_start None -> ''-500''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:339269", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "insert-2026-10-07-002-001: thumbnail_url None -> ''/data/images/wiki/22dba69d/Village hall, Hadzhidimitrovo, Veliko Tarnovo Province.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:347188", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s002: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> ''< 4500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:347189", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s002: period_start ''-500'' -> ''-5230''"}]'::jsonb),
