6d_fields-wd1-s004: period_name ''1000 - 1500 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:95241", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s004: period_start ''1000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:95242", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s004: site_type ''City/town/settlement'' -> ''Castle/palace''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:144679", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-005: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/48/Puruchuco_Archaeological_site_-_overview.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/234bd55f/Complejo Arqueológico Puruchuco 1.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:235613", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s002: period_name None -> ''500 - 1000 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:235614", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s002: period_start None -> ''900''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:333704", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-009-001: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/234bd55f/Complejo Arqueológico Puruchuco 1.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/234bd55f/Puruchuco_Archaeological_site_-_overview.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
    ('235def6a-3971-4308-9248-172c2cb39025'::uuid, 'antiquity', '5', '8', 'card-stats-2026-11-05-rollback:235def6a-3971-4308-9248-172c2cb39025:antiquity', 'rollback of card-stats-2026-11-05: antiquity ''8'' restored on Day House Lane Stone Circle', '9b5ef2c1953514b9e71dec151eccfbfe', '[{"source": "api/cardgame/generator.py:site_card_stats", "url": "api/cardgame/generator.py", "quote": "antiquity = 5 from period_start None"}, {"source": "production export 21200f1e3f26a29a (2026-11-05 22:52:16.465314+00)", "url": "remediation_change_log + unified_sites + card_stats (read-only)", "quote": "counterfactual: 5519 journalled input value(s) put back reproduce the stored card_stats in all 59724 cells (basis: wave 2026-10-04f''s own export (2026-10-04 19:19:41.515456+00))"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:33427", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase4:p4-0018:chunk-0001: description ''Day House Lane Stone Circle, also known as Coate Stone Circle, is a Late Neolithic to Early Bronze Age sarsen megalith circle near Coate on the southeastern edge of Swindon, Wiltshire. Antiquarian A. D. Passmore estimated the original diameter at approximately 69 metres with over thirty stones; by the 1890s only nine survived, reduced to five partly buried stones by the early 21st century. It was one of at least seven stone circles erected in the area south of Swindon, part of a wider ritual landscape linked to nearby Avebury (9 miles southwest). The site is a Scheduled Monument protected under the Ancient Monuments and Archaeological Areas Act 1979.'' -> \"Day House Lane Stone Circle, also known as Coate Stone Circle, is a stone circle near the hamlet of Coate, now on the southeastern edge of Swindon, in the English county of Wiltshire [1]. Five partly buried stones remain at the site [1]. A circle of sarsen megaliths, Day House Lane Stone Circle probably had an original diameter of about 69 metres and possibly contained over thirty stones [1]. It was one of at least seven stone circles that are known to have been erected in the area south of Swindon in northern Wiltshire [1]. The earliest known reference to the site was made by the local writer Richard Jefferies in the 1860s [1]. When the antiquarian A. D. Passmore investigated the site during the 1890s he found nine stones, mostly buried [1]. He observed a line of five stones not far from the circle''s northern end, suggesting that these were part of a prehistoric avenue connected to the circle; these too no longer existed by the 21st century [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:95247", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s004: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:95248", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s004: period_start ''-4000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:246883", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s004: period_name None -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:246884", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s004: period_start None -> ''-4000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:347190", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s002: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:347191", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s002: period_start ''-4000'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
