hed the first settlement there with his people [2] [4] [5] [6].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:339329", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "insert-2026-10-07-002-001: thumbnail_url None -> ''/data/images/wiki/25910998/Easter Island, Ahu Nau Nau (6691343477).webp''"}]'::jsonb),
