ngs were found in Roumald''s Cave [1]. The paintings, all of which were made with red pigment, stretch between 32–46 m from the entrance, and are divided into four panels: three on the left and one on the right wall [1]. 28 out of 44 paintings are located on the left panel L2, which also contains all four of the cave''s figurative depictions [1]. Two of the four figurative depictions are of animals: a bison and an ibex [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:95317", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s004: period_name ''< 4500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:95318", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s004: period_start ''-35000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:246929", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s004: period_name None -> ''500 BC - 1 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:246930", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s004: period_start None -> ''-500''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:347223", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s002: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> ''< 4500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:347224", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s002: period_start ''-500'' -> ''-300000''"}]'::jsonb),
    ('27226cef-1c90-46cc-ac31-6b568c7f6c8a'::uuid, 'mystery', '1', '6', 'card-stats-2026-11-05-rollback:27226cef-1c90-46cc-ac31-6b568c7f6c8a:mystery', 'rollback of card-stats-2026-11-05: mystery ''6'' restored on Duropolis', '79f9a4cf0e8067d6f1e2afc70bfa4c4d', '[{"source": "api/cardgame/generator.py:site_card_stats", "url": "api/cardgame/generator.py", "quote": "mystery = 1 from (''City/town/settlement'', ''500 BC - 1 AD'') is shared by 316 curated site(s)"}, {"source": "production export 21200f1e3f26a29a (2026-11-05 22:52:16.465314+00)", "url": "remediation_change_log + unified_sites + card_stats (read-only)", "quote": "counterfactual: 5519 journalled input value(s) put back reproduce the stored card_stats in all 59724 cells (basis: wave 2026-10-04f''s own export (2026-10-04 19:19:41.515456+00))"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:82392", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase4:p4-2060:chunk-0001: description ''Duropolis is an Iron Age archaeological site at Winterborne Kingston in Dorset, England, believed to be the remains of the first planned town in Britain[1]. Discovered in 2008 by co-directors Miles Russell and Paul Cheetham, the 32,000 square metre settlement dates to around 100 BCE, making it approximately 70 years older than the Roman town of Silchester[1].'' -> ''Duropolis is the name of an archaeological site at Winterborne Kingston in the English county of Dorset, believed to be the remains of the first planned town in Britain [1]. The 32,000 square metres Iron Age settlement is believed to date to around 100 BCE, making it 70 years older than the Roman town of Silchester [1]. The site has been named by archaeologists after the Iron Age Durotriges tribe [1]. Its settlement may have been associated with the abandonment of nearby Maiden Castle in the 1st century BCE [1]. Found in July 2015 by students from Bournemouth University as part of the Durotriges Big Dig project, the remains of 16 Iron Age roundhouses have been excavated while geophysical survey shows a total of at least 150 roundhouses and other features in the area [1]. A number of animal skeletons discovered at the site suggest that the Iron Age Celtic population may have believed in hybrid-animal monster myths akin to those of the Mesopotamians, Ancient Greeks and Egyptians [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:95321", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s004: site_type ''City/town/settlement'' -> ''Settlement''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:324978", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-005-001: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/27226cef/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/27226cef/Duropolis 7.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:355594", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-24_mechanical-site-type-merge-s001: site_type ''Settlement'' -> ''City/town/settlement''"}]'::jsonb),
