en excavated while geophysical survey shows a total of at least 150 roundhouses and other features in the area [1]. A number of animal skeletons discovered at the site suggest that the Iron Age Celtic population may have believed in hybrid-animal monster myths akin to those of the Mesopotamians, Ancient Greeks and Egyptians [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:95321", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s004: site_type ''City/town/settlement'' -> ''Settlement''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:324978", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-005-001: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/27226cef/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/27226cef/Duropolis 7.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:355594", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-24_mechanical-site-type-merge-s001: site_type ''Settlement'' -> ''City/town/settlement''"}]'::jsonb),
    ('27330a46-8900-4b3b-9094-1910364284bf'::uuid, 'antiquity', '5', '3', 'card-stats-2026-11-05-rollback:27330a46-8900-4b3b-9094-1910364284bf:antiquity', 'rollback of card-stats-2026-11-05: antiquity ''3'' restored on Guyaju Caves', '1b7a08496e921e1ff957ce381c8ea4ee', '[{"source": "api/cardgame/generator.py:site_card_stats", "url": "api/cardgame/generator.py", "quote": "antiquity = 5 from period_start None"}, {"source": "production export 21200f1e3f26a29a (2026-11-05 22:52:16.465314+00)", "url": "remediation_change_log + unified_sites + card_stats (read-only)", "quote": "counterfactual: 5519 journalled input value(s) put back reproduce the stored card_stats in all 59724 cells (basis: wave 2026-10-04f''s own export (2026-10-04 19:19:41.515456+00))"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:30953", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-23_owner-case-coordinates: lat ''39.8808439626631'' -> ''40.462413''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:30954", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-23_owner-case-coordinates: lon ''116.32723868715625'' -> ''115.768498''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:33453", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase4:p4-0019:chunk-0001: description \"China''s largest ancient cliff dwelling complex, carved into the slopes of Tianhuang Mountain in Yanqing District, Beijing. The site contains over 350 chambers with rooms featuring carved kang bed-stoves, flues, windows, and lampstands, with some apartment complexes having up to eight rooms suggesting social hierarchy. Discovered in 1984, the caves'' origins remain mysterious -- theories attribute them to the Kumo Xi tribe during the Five Dynasties Period (907-960), a Tang Dynasty granary, or Han Dynasty garrison. The sophisticated construction required significant organization and manpower.\" -> \"Guyaju Caves are the ruins of a cave complex that may have served as dwellings for a fortified community situated in a valley near present-day Dongmenying, Yanqing District, Beijing, China [1]. The cave rooms are packed close to each other and in some places are cut at different levels of the same cliff face, giving the appearance of a multistory building [1]. A Chieftain''s Palace is located at the bottom of one of the rock faces of the complex [1]. This more elaborate residence has 8 rooms and is supported by columns cut from the rock [1]. The ancient cliff dwellings of Yanqing were first discovered in 1984 during a cultural relics survey conducted by the Yanqing County Cultural Relics Administration, and the date of their excavation was inferred to be between 1000 and 2000 years ago, but the exact date has not been determined [1]. The site can be divided into two parts, the front ditch and the back ditch, all of which sit east to west and cover an area of 1.5 square kilometers [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:95322", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s004: period_name ''1 - 500 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:95323", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s004: period_start ''1'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:144761", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-005: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/27330a46/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/27330a46/三居室 - Three Rooms House - 2013.06 - panoramio.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:246931", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s004: period_name None -> ''1 - 500 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:246932", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s004: period_start None -> ''1''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:308594", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-003: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/27330a46/三居室 - Three Rooms House - 2013.06 - panoramio.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/27330a46/Ancient_Cliff_Dwellings_in_Yanqing,_2011-08-03_04.webp''"}, {"so