nd reaches the height of 35m [1]. It consists of raised embankments and walls with large stones alternating with smaller ones; conical adobe bricks are seen in the interior [1]. In front of the \"Templo\" extend five courts or plazas, some with sunken circular courts; this indicates the ceremonial character of the whole complex [1]. The complex is oriented to the northwest, and its length is about 2 km [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:96288", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s005: period_name ''3000 - 1500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:96289", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s005: period_start ''-3000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:96290", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s005: site_type ''Pyramid complex'' -> ''Mound/tumulus''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:145456", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-006: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d5/Vista_de_Sechín_Alto_desde_las_faldas_del_cerro_Sechín.jpg/400px-Vista_de_Sechín_Alto_desde_las_faldas_del_cerro_Sechín.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/2a956522/hero.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:235681", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s002: period_name None -> ''3000 - 1500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:235682", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s002: period_start None -> ''-2000''"}]'::jsonb),
