 was most probably constructed in the late Iron Age, around the 1st century AD [1] [3]. St Martin''s Chapel, on the eastern edge, was built in the early 13th century [1] [3] [4]. Both the hillfort and chapel were designated a scheduled ancient monument in 1925 [1] [4].\""}]'::jsonb),
