 upon which no grass will grow is purported to be where the dragon''s blood spilled [1]. It has been suggested as some sort of Iron Age ritual site associated with the nearby hill figure [1]. It is part of the White Horse group of monuments in the care of the National Trust, and a Scheduled Monument in its own right [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:96379", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s005: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:96380", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s005: period_start ''-800'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:302107", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04a_fields-wd4-s001: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:302108", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04a_fields-wd4-s001: period_start None -> ''-800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:324990", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-005-001: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/2f93c277/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/2f93c277/Dragon Hill.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:347293", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s002: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:347294", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s002: period_start ''-800'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
