h the project was largely put on hold due to lack of funding [1]. The cave is a natural limestone cavity in a dry, rocky landscape, about 20 meters above sea level and 50 meters from the current Mediterranean shoreline [1]. This karstic formation stretches roughly 300 meters in length and 50 meters in width, running east to west [1]. Finds from the excavation include Late Neolithic stone, pottery and clay vessels, jewelry and weapons [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:96408", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s005: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> ''< 4500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:96409", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s005: period_start ''-4000'' -> ''-6000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:146275", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-007: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/305ccaba/hero.webp'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:321325", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-004-001: thumbnail_url None -> ''/data/images/wiki/305ccaba/hero.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:324993", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-005-001: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/305ccaba/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/305ccaba/Diros-cave-greece 16269357444 o.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
    ('30cf4488-c74c-42d8-8e21-a017ca0bf921'::uuid, 'mystery', '2', '7', 'card-stats-2026-11-05-rollback:30cf4488-c74c-42d8-8e21-a017ca0bf921:mystery', 'rollback of card-stats-2026-11-05: mystery ''7'' restored on Pagar Alam', 'c9a1552a3584f8b037c1c7b7c1050c07', '[{"source": "api/cardgame/generator.py:site_card_stats", "url": "api/cardgame/generator.py", "quote": "mystery = 2 from (''City/town/settlement'', ''Undated'') is shared by 159 curated site(s)"}, {"source": "production export 21200f1e3f26a29a (2026-11-05 22:52:16.465314+00)", "url": "remediation_change_log + unified_sites + card_stats (read-only)", "quote": "counterfactual: 5519 journalled input value(s) put back reproduce the stored card_stats in all 59724 cells (basis: wave 2026-10-04f''s own export (2026-10-04 19:19:41.515456+00))"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:80764", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase4:p4-2007:chunk-0001: description ''Pagar Alam is a city on the Pasemah (Besemah) Plateau in South Sumatra, Indonesia, home to one of the most impressive megalithic complexes in Southeast Asia. The highlands around Mount Dempo contain groups of menhirs, stone blocks with mortars, carved troughs with human heads, terraced platforms, dolmens, stone burial chambers, and dynamic carvings of humans and animals. Dating to roughly 2,000 years ago, these monuments were created by the Besemah people, known for their martial prowess and ancestor veneration, with megaliths serving as centres of ritual life.'' -> ''Pagar Alam is located by the Bukit Barisan Mountains, at the feet of Mount Dempo [1]. It is situated on the Pasemah Plateau, an extensive fertile highland plain which is surrounded by mountains [1]. It is notable for ancient stone megaliths which surround the town on all sides and are the remnants of a Bronze Age culture [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:84187", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26a_fields-wd1-s001: period_name ''1 - 500 AD'' -> None"}, {"sour