ct, Taichung, Taiwan [1]. The site was discovered by Tunghai University student Chen Sheng-ming in 2002 [1]. Further investigation revealed the site coverage to be 1,500,000 m2 and the Taichung City Government declared the area to be a City Archaeological Area [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:96432", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s005: period_name ''3000 - 1500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:96433", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s005: period_start ''-2000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:96434", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s005: site_type ''City/town/settlement'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:146289", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-007: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/316b3d27/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/316b3d27/惠來考古遺址.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:236552", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s003: site_type None -> ''Archaeological site''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:247375", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s005: period_name None -> ''3000 - 1500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:247376", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s005: period_start None -> ''-3000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:333725", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-009-001: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/316b3d27/惠來考古遺址.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/316b3d27/hero.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:347307", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s002: site_type ''Archaeological site'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
