    ('3195c970-3603-4a2c-9810-7031b5120420'::uuid, 'mystery', '7', '6', 'card-stats-2026-11-05-rollback:3195c970-3603-4a2c-9810-7031b5120420:mystery', 'rollback of card-stats-2026-11-05: mystery ''6'' restored on Strubben-Kniphorstbos', '442ac68c1b4a4394b3ba27a5694b2663', '[{"source": "api/cardgame/generator.py:site_card_stats", "url": "api/cardgame/generator.py", "quote": "mystery = 7 from (''Megalithic structures'', ''4500 - 3000 BC'') is shared by 10 curated site(s)"}, {"source": "production export 21200f1e3f26a29a (2026-11-05 22:52:16.465314+00)", "url": "remediation_change_log + unified_sites + card_stats (read-only)", "quote": "counterfactual: 5519 journalled input value(s) put back reproduce the stored card_stats in all 59724 cells (basis: wave 2026-10-04f''s own export (2026-10-04 19:19:41.515456+00))"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:44117", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase4:p4-0088:chunk-0001: description ''Strubben-Kniphorstbos, located between Anloo and Schipborg in Drenthe, is the first and only archaeological reserve in the Netherlands, designated in 2000. Covering over 377 hectares, the reserve contains two surviving hunebeds (D7 and D8) built by the Funnel Beaker Culture (3400-2850 BC), dozens of burial mounds from nearly all prehistoric periods, and ancient cart tracks. The largest mound, Galgenberg (Gallows Hill), was later used in medieval times for displaying executed criminals. The landscape preserves authentic Drenthe features including distinctive gnarled oak trees shaped by centuries of sheep grazing.'' -> ''The Strubben–Kniphorstbos is a nature reserve of 377 hectares, located between Anloo and Schipborg in the Dutch province of Drenthe [1]. It is the only archaeological reserve in the Netherlands [1]. The province of Drenthe is rich in archaeological remains of the funnelbeaker culture, with 54 extant dolmens, of which two are within the boundaries of the reserve [1]. It also houses some sixty burial mounds [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:146293", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-007: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/52/Hunebed_D8_Kniphorstbos_bij_Anloo.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/3195c970/Hunebed_D8_Kniphorstbos_bij_Anloo.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
