. Red ochre paintings of human hands, fish, bulls, bison, deer and other objects are visible at the rock shelter [1]. More than 300 cupules have been documented in the rockshelter [1]. Excavations at the rock shelter from 1969 to 1972 recovered seven pieces of charcoal and bone that were radiocarbon dated to between 1,750 and 13,000 years BP [1]. The excavation also recovered over 1,600 stone artifacts as well as many pieces of bone and red ochre [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:97172", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s006: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:97173", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s006: period_start ''-500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:146403", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-007: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d1/Padah-Lin_Cave_1_sign.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/360da20f/Buddhist_stupa_at_Padah-Lin_Cave_1.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:247411", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s005: period_name None -> ''500 BC - 1 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:247412", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s005: period_start None -> ''-500''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:333733", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-009-001: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/360da20f/Buddhist_stupa_at_Padah-Lin_Cave_1.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/360da20f/hero.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:357137", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-25p_fields-wd5-s003: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> ''< 4500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:357138", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-25p_fields-wd5-s003: period_start ''-500'' -> ''-23050''"}]'::jsonb),
