d, they whispered a prayer in his ear, and the entire spectacle disappeared [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:35731", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-25_mechanical-journal-reversal-3: site_type ''Natural feature'' -> ''Megalithic stones''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:116170", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s003: period_name ''< 4500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:116171", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s003: period_start ''-5000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:116172", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s003: site_type ''Megalithic stones'' -> ''Natural feature''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:146975", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-008: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/37065cce/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/37065cce/Carn Kenidjack in November, 2019.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:247425", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s005: period_name None -> ''3000 - 1500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:247426", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s005: period_start None -> ''-3000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:309483", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-004: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/37065cce/Carn Kenidjack in November, 2019.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/37065cce/Carn_Kenidjak_Cornwall.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:348076", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s003: period_name ''3000 - 1500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:348077", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s003: period_start ''-3000'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
