]. Chew Green and Bremenium, nearby Roman encampments on Dere Street, lie to the north and south [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:97187", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s006: period_name ''1 - 500 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:97188", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s006: period_start ''1'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:236595", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s003: period_name None -> ''1 - 500 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:236596", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s003: period_start None -> ''1''"}]'::jsonb),
