 metres above sea level, 50 kilometres from the Pacific Ocean [1]. Its southern acropolis complex was destroyed in 1997 by urban development and the main groups are now covered by sugar cane fields [1]. The site''s geologic context is volcanic; it is located just south of an active stratovolcano, Fuego volcano [1]. The site contains monumental architecture in its acropolis as well as a probable sweatbath and obsidian workshops [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:35732", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-25_mechanical-journal-reversal-3: site_type ''Archaeological site'' -> ''City/town/settlement''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:84200", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26a_fields-wd1-s001: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:84201", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26a_fields-wd1-s001: period_start ''-1500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:146990", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-008: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/37999fa3/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/37999fa3/El Baúl 20.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:247429", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s005: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:247430", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s005: period_start None -> ''-1500''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:309492", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-004: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/37999fa3/El Baúl 20.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/37999fa3/ElBaulSt.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:348078", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s003: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:348079", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s003: period_start ''-1500'