 "remediation_change_log:97219", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s006: period_start ''1'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:247435", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s005: period_name None -> ''1 - 500 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:247436", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s005: period_start None -> ''1''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:339524", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "insert-2026-10-07-003-001: thumbnail_url None -> ''/data/images/wiki/38a93ff8/Camlet Way in Hadley Wood.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:348082", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s003: period_name ''1 - 500 AD'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:348083", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s003: period_start ''1'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
    ('390afd0a-2366-4e5a-bb13-9d8319568abc'::uuid, 'mystery', '1', '5', 'card-stats-2026-11-05-rollback:390afd0a-2366-4e5a-bb13-9d8319568abc:mystery', 'rollback of card-stats-2026-11-05: mystery ''5'' restored on La Joyanca', 'ff6a828a1740cf2b41e3a62e7643acf2', '[{"source": "api/cardgame/generator.py:site_card_stats", "url": "api/cardgame/generator.py", "quote": "mystery = 1 from (''City/town/settlement'', ''500 BC - 1 AD'') is shared by 316 curated site(s)"}, {"source": "production export 21200f1e3f26a29a (2026-11-05 22:52:16.465314+00)", "url": "remediation_change_log + unified_sites + card_stats (read-only)", "quote": "counterfactual: 5519 journalled input value(s) put back reproduce the stored card_stats in all 59724 cells (basis: wave 2026-10-04f''s own export (2026-10-04 19:19:41.515456+00))"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:82822", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase4:p4-2072:chunk-0001: description \"La Joyanca is a pre-Columbian Maya archaeological site in Guatemala''s Petén department, situated south of the San Pedro Martir river and east of the former Maya center of La Florida (Namaan), now the town of El Naranjo on the Mexico-Guatemala border [1]. The site was discovered in 1994 during construction of the Xan-La Libertad oil pipeline and was immediately recognized as an important undiscovered Classic period Maya city [1]. Directed by Charlotte Arnauld, Erik Ponciano, and Veronique Breuil, the La Joyanca project conducted excavations from 1998 to 2003 [1]. Work continued through the Proyecto Peten Noroccidente at related sites including Zapote Bobal and Pajaral [1].\" -> ''La Joyanca is the modern name for a pre-Columbian Maya archaeological site located south of the San Pedro Martir river in the Petén department of Guatemala [1]. The site was discovered in 1994 during the construction of the Xan-La Libertad oil pipeline in Guatemala [1]. It was immediately recognized as an important, undiscovered Classic period (AD 200-900) Maya city and became the focus of an archaeological project [1]. La Joyanca was occupied for well over 1000 years [1]. Dates from the site range from the Late Preclassic (200 BC) to the Terminal Classic/Postclassic (AD 1000) [1]. Population levels reached their height here during the Late Classic (AD 600-900); during this era the rulers of La Joyanca embarked upon an ambitious building project in two areas, dubbed the Plaza Principal and the Grupo Guacamaya [1]. The Grupo Guacamaya, a complex of vaulted rooms and corridors, may have served as their palace and thus the seat of local government [1]. The Grupo Guacamaya was briefly occupied by squatters in the 10th century, but the area was ultimately abandoned by AD 1000 [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:97220", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s006: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:97221", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s006: period_start ''-500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:97222", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s006: site_type ''Temple complex'' -> ''City''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:147058", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-008: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/390afd0a/hero.webp'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:236623", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s003: period_name None -> ''500 BC - 1 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:236624", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s003: period_start None -> ''-200''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:355616", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-24_mechanical-site-type-merge-s001: site_type ''City'' -> ''City/town/settlement''"}]'::jsonb),
