h [1]. The caves are carved out in an east–west longitudinal ridge [1]. Khapara Kodia was damaged by later quarrying, and now only the highest story remains [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:97313", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s006: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:97314", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s006: period_start ''-500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:147743", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-009: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/3e27c892/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/3e27c892/Khapara_Kodiya_Caves_-_Under_Ground_Room_with_Stairs.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:236671", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s003: period_name None -> ''500 BC - 1 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:236672", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s003: period_start None -> ''-300''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:309622", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-004: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/3e27c892/Khapara_Kodiya_Caves_-_Under_Ground_Room_with_Stairs.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/3e27c892/Khapara_Kodiya_Caves_-_Frontside.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:348132", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s003: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:348133", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s003: period_start ''-300'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
