cannibalism [1]. Homo sapiens occupation began around 35,000 years ago [1]. The 35,000 year old humerus of a man from Goyet has been associated with the Aurignacian culture [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:98137", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s007: period_name ''< 4500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:98138", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s007: period_start ''-35000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:148738", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-010: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/4bde4866/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/4bde4866/Neandertal_remains_from_the_Troisième_caverne_of_Goyet_(Belgium).webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:248263", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s007: period_name None -> ''500 BC - 1 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:248264", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s007: period_start None -> ''-500''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:357145", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-25p_fields-wd5-s003: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> ''< 4500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:357146", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-25p_fields-wd5-s003: period_start ''-500'' -> ''-118050''"}]'::jsonb),
