various kingdoms [1]. The Main Gate and Kalyan gate are in good condition [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:98824", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s008: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:98825", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s008: period_start ''-500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:149455", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-011: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/4e7592eb/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/4e7592eb/Jivdhan_storage_building.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:248289", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s007: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:248290", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s007: period_start None -> ''-800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:348225", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s003: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:348226", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s003: period_start ''-800'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
