40 meters, and the small ones have a height of 1–1,5 meters and a diameter of 10–20 meters [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:98917", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s008: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:98918", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s008: period_start ''-500'' -> ''-600''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:149578", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-011: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/543c85d7/hero.webp'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:340409", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "insert-2026-10-07-005-001: thumbnail_url None -> ''/data/images/wiki/543c85d7/Боралдайские петроглифы.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
