ould not have been formed by a hammering action [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:98935", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s008: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:98936", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s008: period_start ''-4000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:150140", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-012: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/55da0a74/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/55da0a74/1751 carving, Ballochmyle, East Ayrshire, Scotland.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:248697", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s008: period_name None -> ''< 4500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:248698", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s008: period_start None -> ''-10000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:311164", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-006: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/55da0a74/1751 carving, Ballochmyle, East Ayrshire, Scotland.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/55da0a74/Cup_marks_at_Mauchline,_Scotland.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:357181", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-25p_fields-wd5-s004: period_name ''< 4500 BC'' -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:357182", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-25p_fields-wd5-s004: period_start ''-10000'' -> ''-4000''"}]'::jsonb),
