ing Skov forest, north of Øster Velling, west of Randers in Jutland [1]. Here there are two small granite boulders with engraved geometric patterns from the Bronze Age [1]. The two stones with petroglyphs stand some fifty metres from their original find spot [1]. There are also the almost completely destroyed remains of the Mandbjerghøj tumulus where the first stone with petroglyphs, which was part of the tumulus fence, was found in 1857 [1]. The tumulus which is now barely visible was originally about 24 m in diameter and four metres high [1]. In the middle of the mound was a typical male grave of the early Bronze Age (c. 1500 BC) [1]. In the grave a bronze sword and a gilt belt-hook were found, which bore the same motif as the rock carvings, thereby demonstrating that the tumulus and the carvings were made at the same date [1]. The stones depict concentric rings and three ovals, which themselves enclose two rings [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:150162", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-012: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/56876b69/hero.webp'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:333826", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-009-001: thumbnail_url None -> ''/data/images/wiki/56876b69/hero.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
    ('568aa67b-d4a2-46f0-91d8-ac0c0e820b75'::uuid, 'antiquity', '10', '3', 'card-stats-2026-11-05-rollback:568aa67b-d4a2-46f0-91d8-ac0c0e820b75:antiquity', 'rollback of card-stats-2026-11-05: antiquity ''3'' restored on Grotta del Cavallo', 'f2717ff1b9a91194a8837fc15fee578a', '[{"source": "api/cardgame/generator.py:site_card_stats", "url": "api/cardgame/generator.py", "quote": "antiquity = 10 from period_start -300000"}, {"source": "production export 21200f1e3f26a29a (2026-11-05 22:52:16.465314+00)", "url": "remediation_change_log + unified_sites + card_stats (read-only)", "quote": "counterfactual: 5519 journalled input value(s) put back reproduce the stored card_stats in all 59724 cells (basis: wave 2026-10-04f''s own export (2026-10-04 19:19:41.515456+00))"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:80850", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase4:p4-2010:chunk-0001: description \"Grotta del Cavallo is a limestone cave near Nardo in Apulia, southern Italy, situated 15m above sea level with a 7m-deep stratigraphic succession. Rediscovered in 1960 and excavated in 1963-1966 and 1986-2008, it yielded critical evidence of the Uluzzian culture. Two deciduous molars found in 1964, initially attributed to Neanderthals, were reanalyzed in 2011 by Stefano Benazzi''s team and published in Nature as early Homo sapiens teeth dating to 45,000-43,000 years BP -- making them the earliest known modern human remains in Europe. The cave also preserves Mousterian Neanderthal layers with four additional teeth, documenting the transition between Neanderthals and modern humans.\" -> ''The Grotta del Cavallo or Cavallo Cave is a limestone cave in the region of Apulia near Nardò 90 km south of Taranto [1]. The cave is about 15 m above present sea level [1]. It has a rounded entrance, 5 m wide and 2.5 m high opening toward the sea [1]. The cave was rediscovered in 1960 and two waves of excavations ensued [1]. The cave contains a rich stratigraphic succession with a depth of 7 m, that is deposited on top of an interglacial beach foundation [1]. In 1964 two deciduous molars were discovered in the cave [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:98955", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s008: period_name ''1 - 500 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:98956", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s008: period_start ''1'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:150165", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-012: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/568aa67b/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/568aa67b/Grotta del Cavallo 2.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:248709", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s008: period_name None -> ''1 - 500 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:248710", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s008: period_start None -> ''1''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:311182", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-006: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/568aa67b/Grotta del Cavallo 2.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/568aa67b/Cavallo2.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:349012", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s004: period_name ''1 - 500 AD'' -> ''< 4500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:349013", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s004: period_start ''1'' -> ''-300000''"}]'::jsonb),
