 succession with a depth of 7 m, that is deposited on top of an interglacial beach foundation [1]. In 1964 two deciduous molars were discovered in the cave [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:98955", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s008: period_name ''1 - 500 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:98956", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s008: period_start ''1'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:150165", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-012: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/568aa67b/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/568aa67b/Grotta del Cavallo 2.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:248709", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s008: period_name None -> ''1 - 500 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:248710", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s008: period_start None -> ''1''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:311182", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-006: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/568aa67b/Grotta del Cavallo 2.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/568aa67b/Cavallo2.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:349012", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s004: period_name ''1 - 500 AD'' -> ''< 4500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:349013", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s004: period_start ''1'' -> ''-300000''"}]'::jsonb),
