unding its base [1]. They are part of Wiryeseong with Pungnaptoseong [1]. A number of important excavations of the site were conducted prior to the construction of the nearby Olympic Park [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:150311", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-012: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/91/Mongchong1.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/5987b6e6/hero.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:325233", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-005-002: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/5987b6e6/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/5987b6e6/Mongchong1.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
