tanding Stone. Despite its significance, the cromlech remains unscheduled and lacks formal heritage protection.\" -> \"Tregele is a small village in northern Anglesey, Wales, near which stands the Llanfechell Cromlech [1]. Late Neolithic and Early Bronze Age rock art was discovered on one of the monument''s stones in 2004-2005 by Dr. George Nash [2] [3]. The site sits within a distinctive prehistoric burial-ritual landscape alongside the Meini Hirion stone group and the Llanfechell Standing Stone [2] [3]. The cromlech remains unscheduled and lacks formal heritage protection [2].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:349039", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s004: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:349040", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s004: period_start ''-500'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
    ('5a440726-598a-48a2-87fc-ae833a534da6'::uuid, 'antiquity', '10', '4', 'card-stats-2026-11-05-rollback:5a440726-598a-48a2-87fc-ae833a534da6:antiquity', 'rollback of card-stats-2026-11-05: antiquity ''4'' restored on Breitenbach - Archaeological Site', '7f4e60917a3218dcf27e7f3735f89c60', '[{"source": "api/cardgame/generator.py:site_card_stats", "url": "api/cardgame/generator.py", "quote": "antiquity = 10 from period_start -50000"}, {"source": "production export 21200f1e3f26a29a (2026-11-05 22:52:16.465314+00)", "url": "remediation_change_log + unified_sites + card_stats (read-only)", "quote": "counterfactual: 5519 journalled input value(s) put back reproduce the stored card_stats in all 59724 cells (basis: wave 2026-10-04f''s own export (2026-10-04 19:19:41.515456+00))"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:84700", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase4:p4-2094:chunk-0001: description ''Breitenbach is a major Aurignacian open-air settlement near Breitenbach village in Saxony-Anhalt, Germany, dating to the early Upper Paleolithic, the period of initial modern human colonization of Europe. It is the largest known Aurignacian settlement site in western Eurasia, providing key evidence for early Upper Paleolithic social organization and spatial planning. Overlying Paleolithic deposits are remains of a later Neolithic settlement[1][2].'' -> ''The archaeological site near the village of Breitenbach in Saxony-Anhalt, Germany is an important open-air settlement that dates to the period of initial colonization of Europe by anatomically modern humans [1]. The occupations date to the early Upper Palaeolithic and more specifically belong to the Aurignacian cultural complex [1]. Breitenbach is currently the biggest open-air settlement site in western Eurasia dating to this time period [1]. Overlying the Palaleolithic deposits are the remains of a younger settlement that has been dated to the Neolithic [1]. The site was discovered in the spring of 1925 by the local school teacher E. Thiersch [1]. Several 14C dates place the occupations at Breitenbach between 23,990±180 and 28,380±170 years ago [1]. The site is primarily known for its mammoth remains [1]. Also occurring in numbers at the site are the remains of horse, reindeer and to a lesser extent those of woolly rhinoceros, hyena, wolf, lion, Arctic fox and Arctic hare [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:99931", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s009: period_name ''< 4500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:99932", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s009: period_start ''-5000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:99933", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s009: site_type ''City/town/settlement'' -> ''Settlement''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:150329", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-012: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/5a440726/hero.webp'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:248755", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s008: period_name None -> ''500 BC - 1 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:248756", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s008: period_start None -> ''-500''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:349041", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s004: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> ''< 4500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:349042", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s004: period_start ''-500'' -> ''-50000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:355859", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-24_mechanical-site-type-merge-s002: site_type ''Settlement'' -> ''City/town/settlement''"}]'::jsonb),
