ng of 1925 by the local school teacher E. Thiersch [1]. Several 14C dates place the occupations at Breitenbach between 23,990±180 and 28,380±170 years ago [1]. The site is primarily known for its mammoth remains [1]. Also occurring in numbers at the site are the remains of horse, reindeer and to a lesser extent those of woolly rhinoceros, hyena, wolf, lion, Arctic fox and Arctic hare [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:99931", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s009: period_name ''< 4500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:99932", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s009: period_start ''-5000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:99933", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s009: site_type ''City/town/settlement'' -> ''Settlement''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:150329", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-012: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/5a440726/hero.webp'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:248755", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s008: period_name None -> ''500 BC - 1 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:248756", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s008: period_start None -> ''-500''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:349041", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s004: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> ''< 4500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:349042", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s004: period_start ''-500'' -> ''-50000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:355859", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-24_mechanical-site-type-merge-s002: site_type ''Settlement'' -> ''City/town/settlement''"}]'::jsonb),
