ury than they now are, but traces of the theater may still be seen, and debris of other buildings [1]. Oscan tombs were excavated there between 1878 and 1886, and important finds of vases and bronzes have been made [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:99957", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s009: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:99958", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s009: period_start ''-500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:150369", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-012: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d8/Suessola-Panoramica.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/5b4e478e/Anfora decorata.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:248773", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s008: period_name None -> ''500 BC - 1 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:248774", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s008: period_start None -> ''-500''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:333850", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-009-001: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/5b4e478e/Anfora decorata.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/5b4e478e/Suessola-Panoramica.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:349049", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s004: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:349050", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s004: period_start ''-500'' -> ''-900''"}]'::jsonb),
