s formerly set beneath a large rectangular cairn 60 ft in diameter and approached by a lintelled passage, so it could be the remains of a passage grave [1]. The 1802 account also says the chamber under the capstone contained ashes and a number of bones [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:99959", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s009: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:99960", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s009: period_start ''-4000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:150370", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-012: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/5b541553/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/5b541553/Annadorn (06), October 2009.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:248775", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s008: period_name None -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:248776", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s008: period_start None -> ''-4000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:311274", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-006: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/5b541553/Annadorn (06), October 2009.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/5b541553/Annadorn_(11),_October_2009.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:349051", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s004: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:349052", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s004: period_start ''-4000'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
