mausoleum, dating to the Goguryeo period, has been the subject of much controversy [1]. This discovery has thus led some North Korean historians to conclude that the mausoleum was discovered and renovated during that period [1]. South Korean historians think it''s more likely to be a tomb of a regional power during the Goguryeo kingdom based on the artifacts found at the site [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:99961", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s009: period_name ''3000 - 1500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:99962", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s009: period_start ''-3000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:248777", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s008: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:248778", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s008: period_start None -> ''-800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:325234", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-005-002: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/5b56e7e6/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/5b56e7e6/Laika ac Mausoleum of Tangun (7987312460).webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:349053", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s004: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:349054", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s004: period_start ''-800'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
