s in the 1970s and 1980s. The site formed part of the broader Scordisci settlement network in the Vinkovci area, reflecting the presence of Celtic peoples in southeastern Pannonia during the late Iron Age. The landscape is characterized by Pannonian Basin plains with agricultural fields.'' -> ''Markusica is a village in Vukovar-Syrmia County in eastern Croatia, located south of the river Vuka and northwest of Vinkovci [1] [2]. A Scordisci archaeological site dating to the Late La Tene culture was excavated here during rescue excavations in the 1970s and 1980s [1] [2]. The site formed part of the broader Scordisci settlement network in the Vinkovci area [1]. The landscape is characterized by Pannonian Basin plains with agricultural fields [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:340499", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "insert-2026-10-07-005-001: thumbnail_url None -> ''/data/images/wiki/5d8a7c0e/Markušica, Crkva silaska duha svetoga na apostole, kod Z-1155, DSC 0014.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
    ('5d8a914c-d69d-409c-9713-588113811da5'::uuid, 'cultural_influence', '8', '7', 'card-stats-2026-11-05-rollback:5d8a914c-d69d-409c-9713-588113811da5:cultural_influence', 'rollback of card-stats-2026-11-05: cultural_influence ''7'' restored on Kalkrieser Berg', '2723f25dd86a920375953fff4d7b4ec1', '[{"source": "api/cardgame/generator.py:site_card_stats", "url": "api/cardgame/generator.py", "quote": "cultural_influence = 8 from description yes, thumbnail yes, 5 content link(s), 1 image(s), source_url yes"}, {"source": "production export 21200f1e3f26a29a (2026-11-05 22:52:16.465314+00)", "url": "remediation_change_log + unified_sites + card_stats (read-only)", "quote": "counterfactual: 5519 journalled input value(s) put back reproduce the stored card_stats in all 59724 cells (basis: wave 2026-10-04f''s own export (2026-10-04 19:19:41.515456+00))"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:84796", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase4:p4-2096:chunk-0001: description ''The Kalkrieser Berg (157 m) is a hill in Lower Saxony where the Varusschlacht Museum and Park opened in 2002 to preserve the likely battlefield of the Teutoburg Forest (9 AD). In 2004 it became the first archaeological museum honored with the Europa Nostra Award. The park encompasses 24 hectares of the historical landscape where Germanic tribes ambushed Roman legions in the narrow passage between the hill and the Grosses Moor bog. Ongoing excavations continue to uncover Roman military artifacts and human remains.'' -> ''The Kalkrieser Berg is a hill, 157 m high, between the villages of Venne and Engter in the district of Osnabrück [1]. The Kalkrieser Berg is a northern bulge of the Wiehen Hills [1]. To the north is the great bog of Großes Moor at a height of about 47 m above sea level, the Mittelland Canal, built in the 20th century, and the Bramsche parish of Kalkriese [1]. Most historians believe that the narrow point – between the Kalkrieser Berg and the great bog – was where the decisive Battle of the Teutoburg Forest between the Romans and the Germanic tribes took place [1]. In the area of Kalkriese artifacts believed to be from the battle have been recovered and many are on display in the Kalkriese Museum and Park [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:117687", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s004: lat ''52.397738493149944'' -> ''52.408''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:117688", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s004: lon ''8.112499997274789'' -> ''8.129''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:117689", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s004: site_type ''Museum'' -> ''Archaeological site''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:117690", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s004: source_url ''https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kalkrieser_Berg'' -> ''https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fundregion_Kalkriese''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:150972", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-013: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/5d8a914c/hero.webp'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:322954", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-004-002: thumbnail_url None -> ''/data/images/wiki/5d8a914c/hero.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:325240", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-005-002: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/5d8a914c/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/5d8a914c/Gipfelkreuz Kalkrieser-Berg (Schmittenhöhe).webp''"}]'::jsonb),
