f the few surviving examples of this method worldwide [1] [2]. The odeon, unearthed in 2012 after three years of excavation, also served as the city''s bouleterion (council house) [3] [4]. The mosaic is seasonally covered for winter protection and reopened each spring [1] [5]. Kibyra was added to the UNESCO World Heritage Tentative List in 2016 [4] [6].\""}]'::jsonb),
