 which was re-established as a Romano-Celtic Temple in the mid-4th century [1]. Several Roman finds including gold coins of Augustus, Nero, and Drusus, two silver denarii of Vespasian and a Roman carnelian ring were found at the site during quarrying [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:84227", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26a_fields-wd1-s001: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:84228", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26a_fields-wd1-s001: period_start ''-1000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:84229", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26a_fields-wd1-s001: site_type ''Fortress/citadel'' -> ''Fort''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:84230", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26a_fields-wd1-s001: source_url ''https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brean_Down'' -> ''https://www.megalithic.co.uk/article.php?sid=25260''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:151102", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-013: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/611a3218/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/611a3218/Brean, UK - panoramio (13).webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:249195", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s009: period_name None -> ''< 4500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:249196", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s009: period_start None -> ''-358900''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:311382", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-006: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/611a3218/Brean, UK - panoramio (13).webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/611a3218/BreanDown2.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:349098", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s004: period_name ''< 4500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:349099", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "20