    ('6148883a-659c-40c4-bcf4-ef086f860f40'::uuid, 'mystery', '5', '6', 'card-stats-2026-11-05-rollback:6148883a-659c-40c4-bcf4-ef086f860f40:mystery', 'rollback of card-stats-2026-11-05: mystery ''6'' restored on Waddon Hill', 'ce00fccaec64cb03cd4c1f61064146e1', '[{"source": "api/cardgame/generator.py:site_card_stats", "url": "api/cardgame/generator.py", "quote": "mystery = 5 from (''Fort'', ''1 - 500 AD'') is shared by 26 curated site(s)"}, {"source": "production export 21200f1e3f26a29a (2026-11-05 22:52:16.465314+00)", "url": "remediation_change_log + unified_sites + card_stats (read-only)", "quote": "counterfactual: 5519 journalled input value(s) put back reproduce the stored card_stats in all 59724 cells (basis: wave 2026-10-04f''s own export (2026-10-04 19:19:41.515456+00))"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:84886", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase4:p4-2099:chunk-0001: description ''Waddon Hill is the site of a Roman fort near Beaminster in Dorset, England, constructed by the Legio II Augusta under Vespasian around AD 50 during the conquest of the Durotriges tribe. The timber fort occupied a narrow ridge at 210 metres elevation and was abandoned around AD 61, coinciding with the Boudiccan revolt. A bath house to the north contained what may be one of the earliest mosaics in Britain. Graham Webster excavated the surviving half of the fort between 1959 and 1969, with 19th-century quarrying having destroyed the other half.'' -> ''Waddon Hill is a hill and the site of a short-lived Roman fort near Beaminster, in the English county of Dorset [1]. The name Waddon is from the Old English, meaning wheat hill [1]. The fort is on a narrow east-west ridge reaching a height of 210 m, with steep natural slopes to the south and west [1]. The fort was built by the Second Legion under Vespasian, but after the occupation of Dorset [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:117746", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s004: site_type ''Fortress/citadel'' -> ''Fort''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:151108", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-013: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/de/Waddon_Hill_-_geograph.org.uk_-_1030076.jpg'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
