levation in the Yanamarca valley near Jauja, Peru. Occupied from approximately 1280 to 1425 AD, the complex contained around 4,300 circular stone dwellings organized around central patios, housing an estimated 16,000 inhabitants. The Wanka were warriors with strong regional identity who developed communal life based on herding, agriculture, and textile production. The site features labyrinthine defensive passages and a sophisticated water distribution system. It was the last Huanca city to surrender when Inca prince Tupac Yupanqui invaded the Mantaro Valley around 1460.'' -> ''Tunanmarca was a pre-Inca settlement located at 3,859 meters elevation in the Yanamarca valley near Jauja, Peru [1] [2]. Occupied from approximately 1280 to 1425 AD, the complex contained around 4,300 circular stone dwellings organized around central patios [1] [2]. The Wanka were warriors with strong regional identity who developed communal life based on herding, agriculture, and textile production [1]. Inca prince Tupac Yupanqui invaded the Mantaro Valley around 1460 [2].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:349102", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s004: site_type ''Archaeological site'' -> ''Settlement''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:355870", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-24_mechanical-site-type-merge-s002: site_type ''Settlement'' -> ''City/town/settlement''"}]'::jsonb),
    ('62406daa-7d26-4ffa-a9d9-54a8be76456e'::uuid, 'mystery', '7', '6', 'card-stats-2026-11-05-rollback:62406daa-7d26-4ffa-a9d9-54a8be76456e:mystery', 'rollback of card-stats-2026-11-05: mystery ''6'' restored on Ballygroll Prehistoric Landscape', '6bf45f63ee80b421c45067e0a5d01d15', '[{"source": "api/cardgame/generator.py:site_card_stats", "url": "api/cardgame/generator.py", "quote": "mystery = 7 from (''Megalithic structures'', ''4500 - 3000 BC'') is shared by 10 curated site(s)"}, {"source": "production export 21200f1e3f26a29a (2026-11-05 22:52:16.465314+00)", "url": "remediation_change_log + unified_sites + card_stats (read-only)", "quote": "counterfactual: 5519 journalled input value(s) put back reproduce the stored card_stats in all 59724 cells (basis: wave 2026-10-04f''s own export (2026-10-04 19:19:41.515456+00))"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:84922", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase4:p4-2100:chunk-0001: description ''An 11-acre Scheduled Monument in the townland of Ballygroll, County Londonderry, Northern Ireland, preserving a remarkable concentration of monuments spanning the Neolithic to Late Bronze Age. Features include a court tomb with a cup-marked capstone, several wedge tombs, two stone circles, cairns, and extensive stone field walls. Archaeological excavations in 1978-1979 investigated a barrow and field walls. The preserved area represents only a fraction of the broader prehistoric landscape on Loughermore Mountain, much of which was lost to agricultural development since the 1830s.'' -> ''Ballygroll Prehistoric Landscape is an 11-acre site in the townland of Ballygroll, County Londonderry [1]. It is a Scheduled Monument and a Monument in State Care [1]. The range and extent of the monuments is remarkable ranging in age from the Neolithic Period until the Late Bronze Age [1]. Most of the monuments on the site have not been fully excavated but it includes several cairns, alignments, standing stones, three different types of grave, a barrow, and a field wall system [1]. The area around the south and west flanks of Loughermore Mountain was first recorded as being an area with a significant number of ancient monuments in Ordnance Survey memoirs in 1835 [1]. However, many of these monuments have been damaged or destroyed [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:100101", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s009: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:100102", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s009: period_start ''-4000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:249203", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s009: period_name None -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:249204", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s009: period_start None -> ''-4000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:325244", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-005-002: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/62406daa/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/62406daa/Wedge Tomb at Ballygroll.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
