 of about 3,889 metres on top of a mountain which is bordered by the little rivers Tawlli and Aqu [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:118881", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s005: lat ''-9.367109446811607'' -> ''-9.357669''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:118882", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s005: lon ''-76.7925678178729'' -> ''-76.809532''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:118883", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s005: period_name ''1 - 500 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:118884", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s005: period_start ''1'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:152272", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-015: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/45/Wata_(Huánuco)_01078.jpg/400px-Wata_(Huánuco)_01078.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/6b730ea0/Huata 00612.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:249289", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s009: period_name None -> ''1 - 500 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:249290", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s009: period_start None -> ''1''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:349159", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s004: period_name ''1 - 500 AD'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:349160", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s004: period_start ''1'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
