ed at the mound which shows the remains of a big ancient city [1]. It is located towards the south of Hyderabad city [1]. Locally, it is famous as the Tower of Sudheran [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:100995", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s010: site_type ''Temple complex'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:238640", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s005: lat ''25.124513078004856'' -> ''25.090986''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:238641", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s005: lon ''68.53922467378919'' -> ''68.466876''"}]'::jsonb),
