00 [1]. Ute, Navaho, and Anglo people have also left carvings on the rock in historic times [1]. There are over 650 rock art designs [1]. The drawings on the rock are of different animals, human figures, and symbols [1]. These carvings include pictures of deer, buffalo, and pronghorn [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:101007", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s010: period_name ''1 - 500 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:101008", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s010: period_start ''1'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:152416", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-015: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/36/Newspaper_Rock_closeup.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/7054234a/Newspaper_Rock_closeup.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:249701", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s010: period_name None -> ''< 4500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:249702", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s010: period_start None -> ''-10000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:345693", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-09a_fields-wd5-s001: period_name ''< 4500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:345694", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-09a_fields-wd5-s001: period_start ''-10000'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
