p Mount Pirwayuq at approximately 3,900 meters (12,795 ft) above sea level. This high-altitude location indicates it functioned as a significant settlement or ritual center during early Andean cultural development, potentially playing a role in the expansion of highland social networks across the central Andes.[1]'' -> ''Located in the Huancavelica Region, Tayacaja Province, within the Laria District, the site sits atop Mount Pirwayuq at approximately 3,900 meters (12,795 ft) above sea level [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:349937", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s005: period_name ''1 - 500 AD'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:349938", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s005: period_start ''1'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
    ('72ca2dcc-e6fc-44a2-93b1-c575e50929dc'::uuid, 'antiquity', '5', '6', 'card-stats-2026-11-05-rollback:72ca2dcc-e6fc-44a2-93b1-c575e50929dc:antiquity', 'rollback of card-stats-2026-11-05: antiquity ''6'' restored on Olympe', 'b3698a62ef46c1dcc2da848f6a7f375e', '[{"source": "api/cardgame/generator.py:site_card_stats", "url": "api/cardgame/generator.py", "quote": "antiquity = 5 from period_start -700"}, {"source": "production export 21200f1e3f26a29a (2026-11-05 22:52:16.465314+00)", "url": "remediation_change_log + unified_sites + card_stats (read-only)", "quote": "counterfactual: 5519 journalled input value(s) put back reproduce the stored card_stats in all 59724 cells (basis: wave 2026-10-04f''s own export (2026-10-04 19:19:41.515456+00))"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:28923", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase3:batch-0214:chunk-0001: period_start ''-1500'' -> ''-400''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:30436", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-22_mechanical-period-name: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''500 BC - 1 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:80986", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase4:p4-2015:chunk-0001: description ''Ancient fortified city of Olympe was located in the territory of the Amantes tribe, strategically positioned between northern Epirus and southern Illyria during classical antiquity. The settlement at modern Mavrovë in Vlorë County, Albania, was fortified between the late 5th and early 4th century BC, reflecting its defensive significance in the region.'' -> ''Olympe was an ancient city located in the territory of the Amantes, between northern Epirus and southern Illyria in classical antiquity [1]. It is located in modern day Mavrovë, Vlorë County, Albania [1]. The settlement at Olympe was fortified between the late 5th century BC and the early 4th century BC [1]. In the Hellenistic period there is evidence for the polis status of Olympe, and Stephanus of Byzantium recorded Olympe as a \"polis of Illyria\" [1]. During the 3rd and 2nd centuries BC Olympe minted bronze coins bearing the inscription ΟΛΥΜΠΑΣΤΑΝ (OLYMPASTAN), and the city-ethnic was probably ’Ολυμπαστάς (Olympastas) [1]. The coins of Olympe depict a snake [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:101684", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s011: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:101685", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s011: period_start ''-400'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:249721", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s010: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:249722", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s010: period_start None -> ''-1500''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:345697", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-09a_fields-wd5-s001: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:345698", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-09a_fields-wd5-s001: period_start ''-1500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:354783", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-19r_fields-wd5-s001: period_name ''Undated'' -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:354784", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-19r_fields-wd5-s001: period_start None -> ''-700''"}]'::jsonb),
