idence for the polis status of Olympe, and Stephanus of Byzantium recorded Olympe as a \"polis of Illyria\" [1]. During the 3rd and 2nd centuries BC Olympe minted bronze coins bearing the inscription ΟΛΥΜΠΑΣΤΑΝ (OLYMPASTAN), and the city-ethnic was probably ’Ολυμπαστάς (Olympastas) [1]. The coins of Olympe depict a snake [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:101684", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s011: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:101685", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s011: period_start ''-400'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:249721", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s010: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:249722", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s010: period_start None -> ''-1500''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:345697", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-09a_fields-wd5-s001: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:345698", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-09a_fields-wd5-s001: period_start ''-1500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:354783", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-19r_fields-wd5-s001: period_name ''Undated'' -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:354784", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-19r_fields-wd5-s001: period_start None -> ''-700''"}]'::jsonb),
    ('72cd16e3-8fc7-49a6-8f6d-efc56c40508d'::uuid, 'antiquity', '7', '8', 'card-stats-2026-11-05-rollback:72cd16e3-8fc7-49a6-8f6d-efc56c40508d:antiquity', 'rollback of card-stats-2026-11-05: antiquity ''8'' restored on Crawley Edge Cairns', '9889d9246f94bf1827eff64aacd2d6bb', '[{"source": "api/cardgame/generator.py:site_card_stats", "url": "api/cardgame/generator.py", "quote": "antiquity = 7 from period_start -2500"}, {"source": "production export 21200f1e3f26a29a (2026-11-05 22:52:16.465314+00)", "url": "remediation_change_log + unified_sites + card_stats (read-only)", "quote": "counterfactual: 5519 journalled input value(s) put back reproduce the stored card_stats in all 59724 cells (basis: wave 2026-10-04f''s own export (2026-10-04 19:19:41.515456+00))"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:34941", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase4:p4-0037:chunk-0001: description ''The Crawley Edge Cairns are a group of 42 Bronze Age round barrows, cairns, and clearance cairns on a south-facing slope in Crawleyside, near Stanhope, County Durham. Ranging from 1.8m to 8.5m in diameter and 0.2m to 1m high, many retain traces of surrounding kerbs. Excavations in the 1970s dated the site to 2000-1500 BC and uncovered a collared urn containing cremated bone, three jet beads, flint tools, and charcoal. The inclusion of clearance cairns alongside burial cairns indicates agricultural land clearance alongside funerary practices. Cairnfields are uncommon in County Durham, making this a notable example.'' -> ''The Crawley Edge Cairns are a series of forty-two Bronze Age round barrows, cairns and clearance cairns located in a field in Crawleyside, near Stanhope, County Durham, England [1]. The cairnfield site lies on a gentle south-facing slope of a hill-spur in Weardale and remains in open moorland [1]. Two of the cairns were excavated in 1977 and surveys undertaken in 1984 and 1991 [1]. The inclusion of clearance cairns at the site is usually taken as an indication of clearance in advance of arable farming, but the Crawley Edge field unusually includes a barrow cremation mound among the cairns [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:101686", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s011: period_name ''3000 - 1500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:101687", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s011: period_start ''-3000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:249723", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s010: period_name None -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:249724", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s010: period_start None -> ''-4000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:349939", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s005: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> ''3000 - 1500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:349940", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s005: period_start ''-4000'' -> ''-2500''"}]'::jsonb),
