 these ruins among pines along the Lycian coast [3] [5].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:118995", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s005: source_url ''https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Phaselis'' -> ''https://kulturenvanteri.com/yer/phaselis-buyuk-hamam/''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:152988", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-016: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/74af1ed2/Buyuk hamam dask.webp'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:340739", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "insert-2026-10-07-005-001: thumbnail_url None -> ''/data/images/wiki/74af1ed2/Beçin Büyük Hamam 5340.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
