    ('768e341f-d9fa-4a3c-a4bf-27d099d7f6da'::uuid, 'mystery', '2', '6', 'card-stats-2026-11-05-rollback:768e341f-d9fa-4a3c-a4bf-27d099d7f6da:mystery', 'rollback of card-stats-2026-11-05: mystery ''6'' restored on Acidava', 'b3da13eb000c3817290c899688bebd56', '[{"source": "api/cardgame/generator.py:site_card_stats", "url": "api/cardgame/generator.py", "quote": "mystery = 2 from (''City/town/settlement'', ''1 - 500 AD'') is shared by 180 curated site(s)"}, {"source": "production export 21200f1e3f26a29a (2026-11-05 22:52:16.465314+00)", "url": "remediation_change_log + unified_sites + card_stats (read-only)", "quote": "counterfactual: 5519 journalled input value(s) put back reproduce the stored card_stats in all 59724 cells (basis: wave 2026-10-04f''s own export (2026-10-04 19:19:41.515456+00))"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:85416", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase4:p4-2113:chunk-0001: description ''Acidava (also known as Acidaua) was originally a Dacian settlement that later became a Roman town and fort, located on the Olt river near the lower Danube [1]. The archaeological remains of this ancient settlement are located in present-day Enoşeşti in Olt County, Oltenia, Romania [2]. The settlement was strategically situated on the Olt river near the lower Danube, which contributed to its importance during both the Dacian and Roman periods [3].'' -> \"Acidava was a Dacian and later Roman town and fort on the Olt river near the lower Danube [1]. The settlement''s remains are located in today''s Enoşeşti, Olt County, Oltenia [1]. After the Roman conquest of Dacia by Roman Emperor Trajan, Acidava became a civilian and military centre, with castra being built in the area [1]. Acidava was part of the Limes Alutanus, a line of fortifications built under emperor Hadrian running north–south along the Alutus river [1]. The function of the limes was to monitor the Roxolani to the east and deter any possible attacks [1]. Acidava is depicted in the Tabula Peutingeriana between Romula and Rusidava [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:101755", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s011: period_name ''1 - 500 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:101756", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s011: period_start ''1'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:153074", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-016: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/768e341f/hero.webp'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:249767", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s010: period_name None -> ''1 - 500 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:249768", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s010: period_start None -> ''1''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:355890", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-24_mechanical-site-type-merge-s002: site_type ''Settlement'' -> ''City/town/settlement''"}]'::jsonb),
