s depicted in the Tabula Peutingeriana between Romula and Rusidava [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:101755", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s011: period_name ''1 - 500 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:101756", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s011: period_start ''1'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:153074", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-016: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/768e341f/hero.webp'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:249767", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s010: period_name None -> ''1 - 500 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:249768", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s010: period_start None -> ''1''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:355890", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-24_mechanical-site-type-merge-s002: site_type ''Settlement'' -> ''City/town/settlement''"}]'::jsonb),
