aces in Europe, with more than 2500 mm a year [1]. These special weather conditions have created over the centuries a unique ecosystem and biodiversity which have made it possible for this area to be declared an Area of National Natural Interest [1]. The ruins of the Phoenician Salt Fish Factory and the Phoenician Port are open to visitors [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:101806", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s011: period_name ''3000 - 1500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:101807", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s011: period_start ''-2000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:153718", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-017: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/bd/Estaca-de-bares.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/79132373/Acantilados de Estaca de Bares.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:250135", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s011: period_name None -> ''3000 - 1500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:250136", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s011: period_start None -> ''-3000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:313018", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-008: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/79132373/Acantilados de Estaca de Bares.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/79132373/Estaca-de-bares.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:345701", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-09a_fields-wd5-s001: period_name ''3000 - 1500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:345702", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-09a_fields-wd5-s001: period_start ''-3000'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
