olithic sites in Thessaly, such as pottery, bone tools, personal ornaments, and both ground and chipped stone tools [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:102517", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s012: site_type ''City/town/settlement'' -> ''Settlement''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:355900", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-24_mechanical-site-type-merge-s002: site_type ''Settlement'' -> ''City/town/settlement''"}]'::jsonb),
    ('7d453e37-a8d8-4124-a619-e7cdc54f8223'::uuid, 'antiquity', '5', '8', 'card-stats-2026-11-05-rollback:7d453e37-a8d8-4124-a619-e7cdc54f8223:antiquity', 'rollback of card-stats-2026-11-05: antiquity ''8'' restored on Coffin Stone', 'faa521fcd3b998cf5f8a9c4531cade03', '[{"source": "api/cardgame/generator.py:site_card_stats", "url": "api/cardgame/generator.py", "quote": "antiquity = 5 from period_start None"}, {"source": "production export 21200f1e3f26a29a (2026-11-05 22:52:16.465314+00)", "url": "remediation_change_log + unified_sites + card_stats (read-only)", "quote": "counterfactual: 5519 journalled input value(s) put back reproduce the stored card_stats in all 59724 cells (basis: wave 2026-10-04f''s own export (2026-10-04 19:19:41.515456+00))"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:85556", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase4:p4-2117:chunk-0001: description \"The Coffin Stone is a large sarsen stone at the foot of Blue Bell Hill near Aylesford in Kent, England. Now lying horizontally, it probably once stood upright nearby. Various archaeologists have argued that the stone was part of a now-destroyed chambered long barrow constructed in the fourth millennium BCE, during Britain''s Early Neolithic period. [1]\" -> ''The Coffin Stone, also known as the Coffin and the Table Stone, is a large sarsen stone at the foot of Blue Bell Hill near Aylesford in the south-eastern English county of Kent [1]. The Coffin Stone is a rectangular slab lying flat that measures 4.42 metres in length, 2.59 metres in breadth, and about 0.61 metres in width [1]. Two smaller stones lie nearby and another large slab is now located atop it [1]. In the 1830s it was reported that local farmers found human bones near the stone [1]. An archaeological excavation of the site led by Paul Garwood took place in 2008–09; it found that the megalith was placed in its present location only in the 15th or 16th centuries [1]. The archaeologists found no evidence of a chambered long barrow at the location, and suggested that the Coffin Stone might once have stood upright in the vicinity [1]. The antiquarian William Stukeley made note of the Coffin Stone in his posthumously published 1776 work Itinerarium Curiosum [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:102522", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s012: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:102523", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s012: period_start ''-4500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:153886", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-017: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/7d453e37/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/7d453e37/Coffin Stone, Blue Bell Hill, Kent 02.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:250175", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s011: period_name None -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:250176", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s011: period_start None -> ''-4000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:313092", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-008: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/7d453e37/Coffin Stone, Blue Bell Hill, Kent 02.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/7d453e37/Coffin_Stone,_Blue_Bell_Hill,_Kent_01.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:350016", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s005: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:350017", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s005: period_start ''-4000'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
