. Severinus established a monastery here [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:153926", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-017: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/58/Passau_Altstadt_Panorama_5.jpg/400px-Passau_Altstadt_Panorama_5.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/7e2b3ee7/Aerial_image_of_Passau.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
