ium suggest that the two cities were part of a trade network along the Volturno River, linking the area with the rest of eastern Campagnia and the coast of the Tyrrhenian Sea, as well as to the northern areas, including the Pentri settlements of Bovianum and Saepinum [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:102546", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s012: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:102547", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s012: period_start ''-500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:153949", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-017: thumbnail_url None -> ''/data/images/wiki/7ef03e67/hero.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:250185", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s011: period_name None -> ''500 BC - 1 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:250186", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s011: period_start None -> ''-500''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:350020", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s005: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:350021", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s005: period_start ''-500'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
    ('7ef5997f-b5ec-4559-9611-8016a7191f0a'::uuid, 'mystery', '5', '6', 'card-stats-2026-11-05-rollback:7ef5997f-b5ec-4559-9611-8016a7191f0a:mystery', 'rollback of card-stats-2026-11-05: mystery ''6'' restored on Katzenberg Hillfort', 'abd178f055760be5efdc374577b558b8', '[{"source": "api/cardgame/generator.py:site_card_stats", "url": "api/cardgame/generator.py", "quote": "mystery = 5 from (''Fort'', ''1 - 500 AD'') is shared by 26 curated site(s)"}, {"source": "production export 21200f1e3f26a29a (2026-11-05 22:52:16.465314+00)", "url": "remediation_change_log + unified_sites + card_stats (read-only)", "quote": "counterfactual: 5519 journalled input value(s) put back reproduce the stored card_stats in all 59724 cells (basis: wave 2026-10-04f''s own export (2026-10-04 19:19:41.515456+00))"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:35059", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase4:p4-0040:chunk-0001: description \"Katzenberg Hillfort is a Roman refuge fortress near Mayen, Germany, established in the early 4th century around 300 AD [1]. It was constructed following the collapse of the Roman limes, when Germanic tribes breached the imperial frontier during the so-called Limesfall [1]. The hillfort served as a secure refuge for inhabitants of the Roman vicus located on the site of present-day Mayen, enabling them to escape danger during invasions [1]. This fortified site represents Rome''s defensive response to increasing pressure on its northeastern frontier provinces [1].\" -> ''Katzenberg Hillfort is a Roman refuge fort near Mayen in Germany dating to the 4th century [1]. The fortification on the Katzenberg hill was built around 300 AD after the Roman limes had been overrun and Germanic tribes had invaded and plundered the Roman Empire [1]. The inhabitants of the Roman vicus, which was located on the site of the present-day town of Mayen, could escape to the fort in time of danger [1]. The Katzenberg was the largest of about 60 Late Roman hillforts which were constructed in the Eifel and Hunsrück regions [1]. They were used for about 70 years and then, after a 30-year pause, used again, in some cases until about 450 AD [1]. The fort covered an area of 1.2 hectares [1]. The remains of the Late Roman hillfort were discovered around 1900 and excavated for the first time between 1907 and 1932 [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:102550", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s012: site_type ''Fortress/citadel'' -> ''Fort''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:153951", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-017: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/7ef5997f/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/7ef5997f/Spätrömische Höhenbefestigung Katzenberg.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:313125", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-008: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/7ef5997f/Spätrömische Höhenbefestigung Katzenberg.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/7ef5997f/Wehrmauer_Römische_Höhenbefestigung_Katzenberg_Mayen_2010.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
