c house life in Europe [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:153959", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-017: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6c/NeolithicVessel_B%26W_1.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/7f7fe84f/hero.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:313131", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-008: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/7f7fe84f/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/7f7fe84f/NeolithicVessel_B&W_1.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
