ildren [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:102560", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s012: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:102561", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s012: period_start ''-4500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:153961", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-017: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/82/Entrance_Portal_Rodmarton_Long_Barrow_-_geograph.org.uk_-_1002575.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/7f9f3957/Chamber in the Forecourt of Windmill Tump.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:239614", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s006: period_name None -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:239615", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s006: period_start None -> ''-4000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:313137", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-008: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/7f9f3957/Chamber in the Forecourt of Windmill Tump.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/7f9f3957/Entrance Portal Rodmarton Long Barrow - geograph.org.uk - 1002575.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
    ('7fe4bb17-d008-4886-a097-c03c66b43f76'::uuid, 'antiquity', '8', '7', 'card-stats-2026-11-05-rollback:7fe4bb17-d008-4886-a097-c03c66b43f76:antiquity', 'rollback of card-stats-2026-11-05: antiquity ''7'' restored on Blackhammer Chambered Cairn', 'f90699e1f44b589559ab42113615eb42', '[{"source": "api/cardgame/generator.py:site_card_stats", "url": "api/cardgame/generator.py", "quote": "antiquity = 8 from period_start -3500"}, {"source": "production export 21200f1e3f26a29a (2026-11-05 22:52:16.465314+00)", "url": "remediation_change_log + unified_sites + card_stats (read-only)", "quote": "counterfactual: 5519 journalled input value(s) put back reproduce the stored card_stats in all 59724 cells (basis: wave 2026-10-04f''s own export (2026-10-04 19:19:41.515456+00))"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:85630", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase4:p4-2119:chunk-0001: description ''Blackhammer Chambered Cairn is a Neolithic chambered cairn on the island of Rousay, Orkney, Scotland. Constructed around 3000 BC, it is an Orkney-Cromarty type chambered cairn featuring stalled burial compartments [1]. Historic Environment Scotland designated the site as a scheduled monument in 1994 [1]. The monument sits near the base of a hillside on Rousay, one of the Orkney islands known for its rich prehistoric heritage [1].'' -> ''The Blackhammer Chambered Cairn is a Neolithic chambered cairn located on the island of Rousay, in Orkney [1]. Historic Environment Scotland established the site as a scheduled monument in 1994 [1]. The site looks out over Eynhallow Sound [1]. The oblong tomb measures 22.5 m by 8.9 m externally [1]. The cairn encloses a long burial chamber measuring 13.5 m by 2 m, and 2 m in height [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:120208", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s006: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:120209", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fie