arge room known as the queen’s room survives [1]. Next to the main gate there is a rock relief showing two soldiers and one pregnant woman [1]. There is also a highly effaced inscription [1]. Although it was thought to be in Armenian, up to now only a few words could be deciphered [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:102625", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s012: period_name ''1 - 500 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:102626", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s012: period_start ''100'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:250217", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s011: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:250218", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s011: period_start None -> ''-800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:325286", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-005-002: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/82ab3246/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/82ab3246/Dağlı Castle, Mersin Province.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:357229", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-25p_fields-wd5-s005: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''500 BC - 1 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:357230", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-25p_fields-wd5-s005: period_start ''-800'' -> ''-27''"}]'::jsonb),
