. Excavations completed before 1910 revealed this large brick-based stupa and numerous terracotta reliefs now displayed in major world museums [1]. Clay tablets containing the Buddhist formula \"Ye Dharma Hetu\" in 7th-8th century script were also found [1]. The stupa was decorated using terracotta sculptures representing the Buddha [1]. According to Henry Cousens, the Kahu-Jo-Daro site was significantly damaged when railway contractors in colonial-era Sindh carted off large quantities of the ancient bricks to use them as track ballast [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:103361", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s013: site_type ''Temple complex'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:154748", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-018: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/8838f1fa/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/8838f1fa/KAHO J DARO.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:239687", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s006: site_type None -> ''Archaeological site''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:313866", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-009: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/8838f1fa/KAHO J DARO.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/8838f1fa/Buddha,_da_mirpur_khas,_sindh_(pakistan),_410_dc_ca.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
    ('884eefd5-fec7-49da-972f-dfd3a8c099ab'::uuid, 'mystery', '4', '5', 'card-stats-2026-11-05-rollback:884eefd5-fec7-49da-972f-dfd3a8c099ab:mystery', 'rollback of card-stats-2026-11-05: mystery ''5'' restored on Bocan Stone Circle', '10bbfe0758507e62837d120fb63dd86a', '[{"source": "api/cardgame/generator.py:site_card_stats", "url": "api/cardgame/generator.py", "quote": "mystery = 4 from (''Stone circle'', ''3000 - 1500 BC'') is shared by 57 curated site(s)"}, {"source": "production export 21200f1e3f26a29a (2026-11-05 22:52:16.465314+00)", "url": "remediation_change_log + unified_sites + card_stats (read-only)", "quote": "counterfactual: 5519 journalled input value(s) put back reproduce the stored card_stats in all 59724 cells (basis: wave 2026-10-04f''s own export (2026-10-04 19:19:41.515456+00))"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:36795", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase4:p4-0043:chunk-0001: description \"Bocan Stone Circle is a Bronze Age monument on Bocan Hill near the village of Culdaff on the Inishowen peninsula in County Donegal, dating to approximately 1500-2500 BC. The circle measures about 18.3 metres in diameter and originally contained around 30 stones, some up to 2 metres tall, though only seven remain standing today. Two tall stones appear to mark an entrance, with an alignment oriented on an east-west axis between Slieve Snaght and the Scottish island of Jura, visible on clear days. In 1816, excavators reported uncovering ''graves'' with ''earthen urns'' within the circle, indicating its use for cremation burials. The site is a protected National Monument situated in a heather-covered field.\" -> ''The Bocan Stone Circle is a stone circle situated near the village of Culdaff in the north of Inishowen, a peninsula on the north coast of County Donegal in Ulster, the northern province in Ireland [1]. The stone circle is located on Bocan Hill, just outside the village of Culdaff on the Inishowen peninsula [1]. It is situated in a heather-covered field [1]. The stone circle has a diameter of about 18.3 metres [1]. Only seven of the stones are currently standing, the others are fallen or broken [1]. There were originally around 30 stones, some up to 2 metres tall [1]. Two tall stones seem to mark an entrance [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:103362", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s013: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> ''3000 - 1500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:103363", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s013: period_start ''-4500'' -> ''-2500''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:155215", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-019: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/884eefd5/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/884eefd5/Bocan Stone Circle II 2016 09 06.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:313869", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-009: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/884eefd5/Bocan Stone Circle II 2016 09 06.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/884eefd5/Bocan_Stone_Circle.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
