rigordian (35,000–20,000 BP) cultures [1]. Complex Mousterian burial structures found at La Ferrasie finally provided the evidence of Neanderthal burial practice [1]. At least seven Neanderthals have been found in La Ferrassie, including infants and one fetus [1]. All specimens were found in a thin 60 cm archaeological layer dated to 74-68 thousand years ago [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:103483", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s013: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:103484", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s013: period_start ''-500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:155916", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-020: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/90923e91/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/90923e91/La Ferrassie Grabungsflächen 2017-09-17.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:251059", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s013: period_name None -> ''500 BC - 1 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:251060", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s013: period_start None -> ''-500''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:313999", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-009: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/90923e91/La Ferrassie Grabungsflächen 2017-09-17.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/90923e91/La_Ferrassie.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:350888", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s006: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:350889", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s006: period_start ''-500'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
