 parts: the city of Las Quintanas, the necropolis of Las Ruedas, and the potter''s district of Carralaceña [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:104232", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s014: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:104233", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s014: period_start ''-500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:156125", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-020: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/71/Necr%C3%B3polis_de_Las_Ruedas.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/96395824/Pintia.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:302165", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04a_fields-wd4-s001: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:302166", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04a_fields-wd4-s001: period_start None -> ''-600''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:323409", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-004-002: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/96395824/Pintia.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/96395824/hero.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:325308", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-005-002: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/96395824/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/96395824/Necrópolis de Las Ruedas.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:357267", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-25p_fields-wd5-s006: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''500 BC - 1 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:357268", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-25p_fields-wd5-s006: period_start ''-600'' -> ''-500''"}]'::jsonb),
    ('964d2a78-6209-4f94-be74-761d59bfd0cc'::uuid, 'mystery', '6', '5', 'card-stats-2026-11-05-rollback:964d2a78-6209-4f94-be74-761d59bfd0cc:mystery', 'rollback of card-stats-2026-11-05: mystery ''5'' restored on Chûn Quoit', '36c3eaf1cbc165b58be7a62a57ba2881', '[{"source": "api/cardgame/generator.py:site_card_stats", "url": "api/cardgame/generator.py", "quote": "mystery = 6 from (''Dolmen'', ''3000 - 1500 BC'') is shared by 22 curated site(s)"}, {"source": "production export 21200f1e3f26a29a (2026-11-05 22:52:16.465314+00)", "url": "remediation_change_log + unified_sites + card_stats (read-only)", "quote": "counterfactual: 5519 journalled input value(s) put back reproduce the stored card_stats in all 59724 cells (basis: wave 2026-10-04f''s own export (2026-10-04 19:19:41.515456+00))"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:44831", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase4:p4-0100:chunk-0001: description ''Chûn Quoit is one of the best-preserved Neolithic quoits in western Cornwall [1]. The structure features a capstone supported by upright stones, creating a chamber typical of Neolithic funerary monuments in southwestern Britain.'' -> ''Chûn Quoit is one of the best preserved of all Neolithic quoits (also called dolmens or cromlechs) in western Cornwall, England, United Kingdom [1]. Chûn Quoit is located in open moorland near Pendeen and Morvah [1]. Standing on a ridge, near the much later constructed Chûn Castle hill fort, it overlooks heather moorland and the open sea [1]. Like the other quoits, the quoit was probably covered by a round barrow, of which much evidence abounds [1]. It was a closed chamber and its mushroom-domed capstone measures 3.3 m (11 ft) by 3 m (10 ft), with a maximum thickness of 0.8 m (2 ft 7 in) [1]. There is a cup mark on top of the capstone [1]. It is supported about 2 m (7 ft) from the ground by four substantial slabs [1]. The site was examined in 1871 but no significant finds were made [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:104234", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s014: period_name ''3000 - 1500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:104235", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s014: period_start ''-3000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:156126", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-020: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/964d2a78/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/964d2a78/Chun Quoit (01).webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:240660", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s007: period_name None -> ''3000 - 1500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:240661", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s007: period_start None -> ''-2400''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:334612", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-009-002: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/964d2a78/Chun Quoit (01).webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/964d2a78/Chun_Quoit.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
