een 1.2 and 1.4 m in height [1]. An excavation was carried out in 1898 and a number of charcoal fragments were discovered within the circles [1]. The circles were restored and many fallen stones re-erected in 1909 [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:104238", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s014: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:104239", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s014: period_start ''-4500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:156131", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-020: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/96938167/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/96938167/Grey_Wethers_stone_circle_in_the_snow_on_Dartmoor.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:251121", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s013: period_name None -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:251122", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s013: period_start None -> ''-4000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:314095", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-009: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/96938167/Grey_Wethers_stone_circle_in_the_snow_on_Dartmoor.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/96938167/Grey Wethers 14(1).webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:350930", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s006: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> ''3000 - 1500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:350931", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s006: period_start ''-4000'' -> ''-2500''"}]'::jsonb),
