mhara Region of Ethiopia renowned for its 11 monolithic rock-hewn churches, carved directly from solid volcanic rock using hammers and chisels. Attributed to the 13th-century King Gebre Meskel Lalibela of the Zagwe dynasty, the churches were intended to recreate Jerusalem in Ethiopia. Inscribed as a UNESCO World Heritage Site in 1978, the complex sits at 2,480 metres elevation and includes both free-standing and semi-monolithic structures connected by tunnels. Recent excavations dated earlier secular occupation of the site to 900-1100 AD.'' -> ''Lalibela is roughly 2,500 metres above sea level [1]. Recent archaeological excavations at Lalibela have yielded abundant pottery and faunal remains dating to 900–1100, indicating that the site was largely a secular settlement before being transformed into a religious center by King Lalibela [1]. According to the Futuh al-Habasha of Shihab al-Dīn Aḥmad ibn ʿAbd al-Qādir ibn Sālim ibn ʿUthmān, Ahmad ibn Ibrahim al-Ghazi burned one of the churches of Lalibela during his invasion of Ethiopia [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:121531", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s007: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> ''1000 - 1500 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:121532", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s007: period_start ''-500'' -> ''1181''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:121533", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s007: site_type ''Temple complex'' -> ''Church''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:121534", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s007: source_url ''https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lalibela'' -> ''https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rock-Hewn_Churches,_Lalibela''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:156699", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-021: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/97bdea94/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/97bdea94/Lalibela,_san_giorgio,_esterno_24.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:355929", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-24_mechanical-site-type-merge-s002: site_type ''Church'' -> ''Church/cathedral''"}]'::jsonb),
