eia in Mysia on the Hellespont [1]. Founded in 709 B.C., the ancient city of Parion is located in the village of Kemer in the township of Biga in Çanakkale province of Turkey [1]. In Parion there was a monumental altar which, according to the ancient writer Strabo, had sides the length of a stadion [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:121535", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s007: site_type ''Necropolis/tombs complex'' -> ''City''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:156702", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-021: thumbnail_url None -> \"/data/images/wiki/9803a37d/Ruines d''un Monument carré à Parium - Choiseul-gouffier Gabriel Florent Auguste De - 1822.webp\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:355930", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-24_mechanical-site-type-merge-s002: site_type ''City'' -> ''City/town/settlement''"}]'::jsonb),
