thwork 63 metres in length and with a maximum width of 22 metres [1]. Hazleton North contained two burial chambers, the south chamber and the north chamber, which were both in a semi-collapsed condition [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:121556", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s007: lat ''51.85816821809968'' -> ''51.86863''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:121557", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s007: lon ''-1.8861003739220312'' -> ''-1.895383''"}]'::jsonb),
