Guatemala [1]. The site is situated approximately 1.2 km (0.75 mi) west of the site of Holmul, and the relationship between these two sites during the Classic period occupations is a main focus of ongoing investigations [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:104317", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s014: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> ''1 - 500 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:104318", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s014: period_start ''-500'' -> ''350''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:104319", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s014: site_type ''City/town/settlement'' -> ''Palace''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:156801", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-021: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/9b14cbe4/hero.webp'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
