ea about 10 acres [1]. It is bounded in the north and west by a single bank, width 20 feet and height 3 feet; an outer ditch, now buried, has been revealed by partial excavation [1]. In the south there is a double bank; the banks are up to 24 feet wide, and the ditch between is about 10 feet wide [1]. There are traces of additional earthworks to the south [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:104327", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s014: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:104328", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s014: period_start ''-1000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:251481", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s014: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:251482", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s014: period_start None -> ''-800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:314785", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-010: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/9b3bade9/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/9b3bade9/Buzbury Rings (geograph 3293909).webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:350954", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s006: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:350955", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s006: period_start ''-800'' -> ''-4000''"}]'::jsonb),
