ds [1]. Archaeological investigations continued under the auspices of the Swedish Institute at Athens in the 1930s and then during the 1980s and 1990s that found two settlement areas on two different sides of the Mastos hill slope, belonging to the Early and Late Helladic periods, respectively [1]. They have found chamber tombs and large amounts of pottery that testify that the place was an important center of production of this material for many centuries [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:121612", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s007: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:121613", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s007: period_start ''-4000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:157543", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-022: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/cb/Prosymna_Tholos_4.JPG'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/9f99919a/Prosymna_Tholos_4.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:251519", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s014: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:251520", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s014: period_start None -> ''-800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:350983", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s006: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:350984", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s006: period_start ''-800'' -> ''-4000''"}]'::jsonb),
