]. The main polygonal chamber, measuring 3.85 m x 3.4 m, reached by an entrance corridor, was covered by transverse slabs [1]. A trapezoidal chamber on the left side was a separate compartment, measuring 3.5m x 1.5m [1]. In addition to skeletons, many funerary offerings have been discovered [1]. The dolmen is situated high on a hill that visually dominates the surrounding Vale de Figueira area [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:325316", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-005-002: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/a023ea22/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/a023ea22/DolmendaPedraBranca1.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
