ought over by Europeans [1]. Large defensive ditches and palisades were built around some of the communities at Kuhikugu [1]. Many of the communities at Kuhikugu were linked, with roads which bridged some rivers along their paths, and with canoe canals running alongside some of the roads [1]. Sites X35 and X34 are significant communities connected by two of these roads [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:105066", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s015: period_name ''500 - 1000 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:105067", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s015: period_start ''500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:157562", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-022: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/a0b08567/hero.webp'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:251523", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s014: period_name None -> ''500 - 1000 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:251524", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s014: period_start None -> ''500''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:350987", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s006: period_name ''500 - 1000 AD'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:350988", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s006: period_start ''500'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
    ('a0d4a5ea-fb2c-435c-a8b0-a6e12143b007'::uuid, 'mystery', '5', '4', 'card-stats-2026-11-05-rollback:a0d4a5ea-fb2c-435c-a8b0-a6e12143b007:mystery', 'rollback of card-stats-2026-11-05: mystery ''4'' restored on Little Kit''s Coty House', 'f1f127efce3a848af2c744f8fad180cb', '[{"source": "api/cardgame/generator.py:site_card_stats", "url": "api/cardgame/generator.py", "quote": "mystery = 5 from (''Barrow'', ''4500 - 3000 BC'') is shared by 33 curated site(s)"}, {"source": "production export 21200f1e3f26a29a (2026-11-05 22:52:16.465314+00)", "url": "remediation_change_log + unified_sites + card_stats (read-only)", "quote": "counterfactual: 5519 journalled input value(s) put back reproduce the stored card_stats in all 59724 cells (basis: wave 2026-10-04f''s own export (2026-10-04 19:19:41.515456+00))"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:86414", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase4:p4-2141:chunk-0001: description \"Little Kit''s Coty House, also called Lower Kit''s Coty House or the Countless Stones, is a chambered long barrow near Aylesford in Kent, England. Constructed around 4000 BCE during the Early Neolithic, the site now survives in a ruined state, with its original chambered structure largely destroyed. [1]\" -> \"Little Kit''s Coty House, also known as Lower Kit''s Coty House and the Countless Stones, is a chambered long barrow located near to the village of Aylesford in the southeastern English county of Kent [1]. Constructed circa 4000 BCE, during the Early Neolithic period of British prehistory, today it survives in a ruined state [1]. Archaeologists have established that the monument was built by pastoralist communities shortly after the introduction of agriculture to Britain from continental Europe [1]. Archaeological evaluation trenching in 1989 found no clear evidence of any surrounding quarry ditch which would normally have been excavated to provide material for a covering barrow [1]. In 2005, Philp and Dutto noted that there were about 21 stones at the site [1]. Many of these would have once formed part of a chamber at the eastern end of a long, rectangular earthen mound [1]. The sarsens found at Little Kit''s Coty House are among the largest known from the Medway Megaliths [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:105070", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s015: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:105071", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s015: period_start ''-4500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:157569", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-022: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/a0d4a5ea/hero.webp'' -> \"/data/images/wiki/a0d4a5ea/Little_Kit''s_Coty_House,_Blue_Bell_Hill_07.webp\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:240755", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s007: period_name None -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:240756", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s007: period_start None -> ''-4000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:314894", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-010: thumbnail_url \"/data/images/wiki/a0d4a5ea/Little_Kit''s_Coty_House,_Blue_Bell_Hill_07.webp\" -> \"/data/images/wiki/a0d4a5ea/Little_Kit''s_Coty_House,_Blue_Bell_Hill_01.webp\""}]'::jsonb),
