t the site [1]. Many of these would have once formed part of a chamber at the eastern end of a long, rectangular earthen mound [1]. The sarsens found at Little Kit''s Coty House are among the largest known from the Medway Megaliths [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:105070", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s015: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:105071", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s015: period_start ''-4500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:157569", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-022: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/a0d4a5ea/hero.webp'' -> \"/data/images/wiki/a0d4a5ea/Little_Kit''s_Coty_House,_Blue_Bell_Hill_07.webp\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:240755", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s007: period_name None -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:240756", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s007: period_start None -> ''-4000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:314894", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-010: thumbnail_url \"/data/images/wiki/a0d4a5ea/Little_Kit''s_Coty_House,_Blue_Bell_Hill_07.webp\" -> \"/data/images/wiki/a0d4a5ea/Little_Kit''s_Coty_House,_Blue_Bell_Hill_01.webp\""}]'::jsonb),
