oing since 2001 continue to reveal information on this recently recognized and highly significant settlement from the Iron Age, which at its climax comprised at least 450 buildings and included a halidom district with several cult sites [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:105118", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s015: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:105119", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s015: period_start ''-500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:157684", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-022: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3b/Platt_old%2Bnew_church.jpg'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:251553", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s014: period_name None -> ''500 BC - 1 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:251554", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s014: period_start None -> ''-500''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:314952", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-010: thumbnail_url None -> ''/data/images/wiki/a3c3f3e8/Platt_old+new_church.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:351007", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s006: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:351008", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s006: period_start ''-500'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
