al times during the Goryeo and the Joseon periods [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:105127", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s015: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:105128", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s015: period_start ''-500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:251559", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s014: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:251560", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s014: period_start None -> ''-800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:351758", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s007: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:351759", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s007: period_start ''-800'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
