r its finder, Ray Sweet [1]. Built in 3807 or 3806 BC, the track was a walkway consisting mainly of planks of oak laid end-to-end, supported by crossed pegs of ash, oak, and lime, driven into the underlying peat [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:158255", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-023: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/66/Sweettrack.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/a627df4e/Sweet_track_cross_section2.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:314985", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-010: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/a627df4e/Sweet_track_cross_section2.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/a627df4e/Sweettrack.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
    ('a68e0f4e-3d6a-4e33-a768-b7fad0b07a8e'::uuid, 'antiquity', '8', '7', 'card-stats-2026-11-05-rollback:a68e0f4e-3d6a-4e33-a768-b7fad0b07a8e:antiquity', 'rollback of card-stats-2026-11-05: antiquity ''7'' restored on Dendra', '94d40f6f9f8730f625aef5f42e1b0b3a', '[{"source": "api/cardgame/generator.py:site_card_stats", "url": "api/cardgame/generator.py", "quote": "antiquity = 8 from period_start -4000"}, {"source": "production export 21200f1e3f26a29a (2026-11-05 22:52:16.465314+00)", "url": "remediation_change_log + unified_sites + card_stats (read-only)", "quote": "counterfactual: 5519 journalled input value(s) put back reproduce the stored card_stats in all 59724 cells (basis: wave 2026-10-04f''s own export (2026-10-04 19:19:41.515456+00))"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:29505", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase3:batch-0299:chunk-0001: site_type ''City/town/settlement'' -> ''Archaeological site''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:43637", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase4:p4-0078:chunk-0001: description ''Dendra is a major Mycenaean cemetery in the Argolid, Greece, about 1 km from the citadel of Midea. First excavated in 1926 by Swedish archaeologist Axel W. Persson, the site comprises a tholos tomb, three tumuli, and sixteen chamber tombs containing elite burials with gold and silver cups, jewellery, and bronze weapons. In 1960, tomb no. 12 yielded a complete bronze panoply dating to c. 1400 BC -- the earliest known suit of beaten bronze armour -- demonstrating advanced Mycenaean metalworking and elite chariot warfare. The cemetery is considered the necropolis of nearby Midea and one of the richest Mycenaean burial grounds in the Peloponnese.'' -> ''Dendra is a prehistoric archaeological site situated outside the village with the same name belonging to the municipality of Midea in the Argolid, Greece [1]. The site of Dendra is approximately 6 kilometres from the town of Argos [1]. It was inhabited during the Neolithic and Early Helladic periods, and used as a cemetery between the Late Helladic II period and Late Helladic IIIB (that is, c.\\u20091450 – c.\\u20091180 BCE) [1]. The cemetery consists of a tholos tomb, three tumuli and sixteen chamber tombs, and is one of the richest known from the Mycenaean period [1]. Persson named the tholos tomb the \"Royal Tomb\", and determined that it dated to the Late Helladic IIIA period (c.\\u20091350 BCE) [1]. The cemetery at Dendra was first excavated in 1926, when Nikolaos Bertos, the local ephor of the Greek Archaeological Service, invited Persson to excavate its tholos tomb [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:105148", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s015: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:105149", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s015: period_start ''-4000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:158266", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-023: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/a68e0f4e/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/a68e0f4e/Dendra 2.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:251571", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s014: period_name None -> ''3000 - 1500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:251572", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s014: period_start None -> ''-3000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:314988", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-010: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/a68e0f4e/Dendra 2.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/a68e0f4e/Dendra_tholos_tomb.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:351768", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s007: period_name ''3000 - 1500 BC'' -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:351769", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s007: period_start ''-3000