walls in 87 AD before Domitian''s Dacian War [1]. It was completely restored in the second half of the 3rd century [1]. In the 4th c. protruding semicircular corner-towers were added [1]. An early Christian basilica was discovered on the site [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:105150", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s015: period_name ''1 - 500 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:105151", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s015: period_start ''1'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:105152", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s015: site_type ''City/town/settlement'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:158267", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-023: thumbnail_url None -> ''/data/images/wiki/a692e959/Taliata.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:240796", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s007: period_name None -> ''1 - 500 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:240797", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s007: period_start None -> ''1''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:240798", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s007: site_type None -> ''Fort''"}]'::jsonb),
