f 3,400 m (11,200 ft) [1]. Wilcahuaín is regarded as one of the most important archaeological sites of the Wari culture [1]. It was possibly built ca. 1100 AD [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:105166", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s015: period_name ''1000 - 1500 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:105167", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s015: period_start ''1000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:105168", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s015: site_type ''City/town/settlement'' -> ''Temple''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:158288", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-023: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/bb/WillkawainTempel2.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/a7abbf5d/Huilcahuaín.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:241611", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s008: period_name None -> ''1000 - 1500 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:241612", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s008: period_start None -> ''1100''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:315009", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-010: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/a7abbf5d/Huilcahuaín.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/a7abbf5d/WillkawainTempel2.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:357291", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-25p_fields-wd5-s007: period_name ''1000 - 1500 AD'' -> ''500 - 1000 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:357292", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-25p_fields-wd5-s007: period_start ''1100'' -> ''600''"}]'::jsonb),
