tigated during excavations of the international archaeological expedition Azerbaijan-France in 2015 [1]. Vali Baxşəliyev and Catherine Marro were the leaders of the expedition [1]. During the excavation, painted ceramic pieces from the V millennium BC came to light [1]. Such ancient finds are very rare for the region [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:105185", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s015: period_name ''< 4500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:105186", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s015: period_start ''-5000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:105187", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s015: site_type ''City/town/settlement'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:158320", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-023: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fb/Uzun_oba_ya%C5%9Fay%C4%B1%C5%9F_yeri.png'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/a81c53d3/hero.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:241620", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s008: period_name None -> ''< 4500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:241621", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s008: period_start None -> ''-5000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:241622", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s008: site_type None -> ''Settlement''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:355947", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-24_mechanical-site-type-merge-s002: site_type ''Settlement'' -> ''City/town/settlement''"}]'::jsonb),
