ounds ranging from between 8 and 20 metres in height [1]. Some of these are built atop natural hills: the upper plaza at the site was constructed on a modified hill 300 metres long by 30 metres high [1]. However, the architecture at the heart of Pajaral is massive: for example, the Main Plaza at Pajaral is accessed by a well-preserved, enormous staircase 46 metres wide and perhaps 30 metres long [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:105218", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s015: period_name ''1 - 500 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:105219", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s015: period_start ''1'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:105220", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s015: site_type ''City/town/settlement'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:241636", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s008: lat ''16.902719920239637'' -> ''17.13015''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:241637", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s008: lon ''-89.90071602546777'' -> ''-90.44553''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:241638", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s008: site_type None -> ''City''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:251925", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s015: period_name None -> ''1 - 500 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:251926", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s015: period_start None -> ''1''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:351796", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s007: period_name ''1 - 500 AD'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:351797", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s007: period_start ''1'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:355949", "url": "r