"url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s015: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:105249", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s015: period_start ''-4000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:158438", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-023: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/ab20e4ad/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/ab20e4ad/Heel Stone and Stonehenge 2025-07-23.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:251939", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s015: period_name None -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:251940", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s015: period_start None -> ''-4000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:315670", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-011: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/ab20e4ad/Heel Stone and Stonehenge 2025-07-23.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/ab20e4ad/Stonehenge_Heel_Stone_-_panoramio_(2).webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:351806", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s007: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> ''3000 - 1500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:351807", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s007: period_start ''-4000'' -> ''-3000''"}]'::jsonb),
    ('ab28cd35-6f8c-4789-80df-a123993db0b0'::uuid, 'mystery', '8', '9', 'card-stats-2026-11-05-rollback:ab28cd35-6f8c-4789-80df-a123993db0b0:mystery', 'rollback of card-stats-2026-11-05: mystery ''9'' restored on Tumlehed Rock Painting', 'd6ebc4af8c454819d92794fa138cec60', '[{"source": "api/cardgame/generator.py:site_card_stats", "url": "api/cardgame/generator.py", "quote": "mystery = 8 from (''Rock art'', ''4500 - 3000 BC'') is shared by 4 curated site(s)"}, {"source": "production export 21200f1e3f26a29a (2026-11-05 22:52:16.465314+00)", "url": "remediation_change_log + unified_sites + card_stats (read-only)", "quote": "counterfactual: 5519 journalled input value(s) put back reproduce the stored card_stats in all 59724 cells (basis: wave 2026-10-04f''s own export (2026-10-04 19:19:41.515456+00))"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:86654", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase4:p4-2148:chunk-0001: description ''The Tumlehed Rock Painting is a prehistoric pictograph site on Hisingen island, Gothenburg, Sweden, created between 4200-2500 BC by mobile hunters who traveled by boat to the west coast. It is the southernmost recorded rock painting in Sweden. Using NASA-developed DStretch imaging, University of Gothenburg researchers revealed previously invisible motifs including boats with elk-head stems, the first such depictions documented in southern or western Scandinavia. The red-painted pictographs also depict ships, fish, a deer, and wave patterns, providing evidence of long-distance sea voyages undertaken by Stone Age maritime hunters.'' -> ''The Tumlehed rock painting is a prehistoric rock art pictograph site, located in Tumlehed on the island of Hisingen, Gothenburg Municipality [1]. It is the southernmost recorded rock painting in Sweden and one of few found in the western parts of the country [1]. A minor excavation was carried out in 1985 of the area next to the painting, but no significant finds were made [1]. Situated on a steep cliff face, covering about 2 x 2 meters, it depicts a number of figures, among them four ships, four fish, a large deer, wave-like patterns, and some undetermined shapes [1]. The painting was made with a mixture of red ochre and a binder which through bonding with the rock has survived the years [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:158439", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-023: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/38/H%C3%A4llm%C3%A5lningen_i_Tumlehed_%28Ra%C3%A4-nr_Torslanda_216-1%29_4373.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/ab28cd35/Hällmålningen i Tumlehed (RAÄ-nr Torslanda 216-1) 4384.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:324461", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-004-003: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/ab28cd35/Hällmålningen i Tumlehed (RAÄ-nr Torslanda 216-1) 4384.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/ab28cd35/hero.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:325984", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-005-003: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/ab28cd35/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/ab28cd35/Hällmålningen i Tumlehed (Raä-nr Torslanda 216-1) 4373.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:351809", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s007: lat ''57.733465010781245'' -> ''57.731935''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:351810", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s007: lon ''11.716677426446076'' -> ''11.740266''"}]'::jsonb),
