 Greenwell and Llewellynn Jewitt excavated at the site, and in the late 1930s the Derbyshire Archaeological Society set two of the orthostats standing again [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:105966", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s016: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:105967", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s016: period_start ''-4500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:159059", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-024: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/eb/Nine_Stones_Close_stone_circle_on_Harthill_Moor.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/ad4967fa/Nine_Stones_Close,_Derbyshire;_removed_upright_in_field_gate.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:251957", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s015: period_name None -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:251958", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s015: period_start None -> ''-4000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:334696", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-009-002: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/ad4967fa/Nine_Stones_Close,_Derbyshire;_removed_upright_in_field_gate.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/ad4967fa/hero.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:351823", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s007: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> ''3000 - 1500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:351824", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s007: period_start ''-4000'' -> ''-2900''"}]'::jsonb),
