te where war booty was sacrificed [1]. It has similarities to the site Skedemosse on Öland and to Migration Period war-booty sites in Denmark and northern Germany [1]. A few finds consist of complete and intact bridles and sword belt sets that have been placed in pits [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:159098", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-024: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/ae6974c3/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/ae6974c3/Drakskatten från Finnestorp (2009) 4173.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:315732", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-011: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/ae6974c3/Drakskatten från Finnestorp (2009) 4173.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/ae6974c3/Oden_förgylld_praktremsölja_fr_Finnestorp_(RAÄ-nr_Larv_121-1_Fnr_224)_2747.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
