, Pietro de Pace, who made use of the tunnel in 1508–1509 to plunder the ruins of Cumae, which, at the time, still bore many rich items [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:122899", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s008: site_type ''Megalithic structures'' -> ''Road''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:159140", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-024: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/afac29e1/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/afac29e1/Grotta_di_Cocceio_-_uscita_via_Arco_Felice_Vecchio_(2018)_01.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:315756", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-011: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/afac29e1/Grotta_di_Cocceio_-_uscita_via_Arco_Felice_Vecchio_(2018)_01.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/afac29e1/Grotta_di_Cocceio_1.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:356159", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-24_mechanical-site-type-merge-s003: site_type ''Road'' -> ''Road/avenue/trackway''"}]'::jsonb),
