 was a partial human molar [1]. At the time it was found scientists were unable to determine whether it was Homo sapiens or Neanderthal [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:106072", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s016: period_name ''< 4500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:106073", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s016: period_start ''-50000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:159254", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-024: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7f/Abime_Couvin.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/b27d56e3/hero.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:252339", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s016: period_name None -> ''500 BC - 1 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:252340", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s016: period_start None -> ''-500''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:351850", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s007: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> ''< 4500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:351851", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s007: period_start ''-500'' -> ''-42550''"}]'::jsonb),
