l and cremated remains, now preserved by the National Museum of Ireland in Dublin [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:122925", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s008: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:122926", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s008: period_start ''-4000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:122927", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s008: source_url ''https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tibradden_Mountain'' -> ''https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tibradden_Cairn''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:159258", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-024: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f0/Tibradden_Chambered_Cairn.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/b2a97f1e/Tibradden Passage Grave.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:252341", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s016: period_name None -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:252342", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s016: period_start None -> ''-4000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:315819", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-011: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/b2a97f1e/Tibradden Passage Grave.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/b2a97f1e/Tibradden_Chambered_Cairn.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:351852", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s007: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> ''3000 - 1500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:351853", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s007: period_start ''-4000'' -> ''-2500''"}]'::jsonb),
