ecause of waterlogging [1]. Radiocarbon dating has indicated that the ages of these boats spanned a period of about 1,000 years, with the earliest examples dating to around 1750–1650 BC [1]. In 2019 researchers at Cambridge and Bristol universities revealed the results of a study of human and dog coprolites found at the site [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:159314", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-024: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3f/Must_Farm_CL3_4817_%2826447110732%29_crop.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/b36ba7d0/Must_Farm_CL3_4804_(26539447815).webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:334708", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-009-002: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/b36ba7d0/Must_Farm_CL3_4804_(26539447815).webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/b36ba7d0/hero.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:356166", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-24_mechanical-site-type-merge-s003: site_type ''Settlement'' -> ''City/town/settlement''"}]'::jsonb),
