he Late Classic period, Cotzumalhuapa was a major city that extended more than 10 square kilometres [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:106102", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s016: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:106103", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s016: period_start ''-1500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:106104", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s016: site_type ''City/town/settlement'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:241760", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s008: site_type None -> ''Archaeological site''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:252365", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s016: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:252366", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s016: period_start None -> ''-1500''"}]'::jsonb),
