e of Lusitania [1]. The Forum consisted of a large square sided by a monumental portico, with a large temple in the center, which was accessed through the Arch of Trajan [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:159947", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-025: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fb/Merida_Arco_de_Trajano.JPG'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/b4990b79/hero.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
