o the wall on either side of the middle inner doorway leading from the nave towards the sanctuary [1]. The church was discovered in 1986 and excavated by the Saudi Department of Antiquities in 1987 [1]. The church originally belonged to the Church of the East, a branch of Eastern Christianity in West Asia [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:106846", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s017: period_name ''1 - 500 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:106847", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s017: period_start ''1'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:160006", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-025: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/b7319c81/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/b7319c81/Jubail Church 2.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:252403", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s016: period_name None -> ''500 - 1000 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:252404", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s016: period_start None -> ''800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:315894", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-011: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/b7319c81/Jubail Church 2.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/b7319c81/Jubail_Church.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:351890", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s007: period_name ''500 - 1000 AD'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:351891", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s007: period_start ''800'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
