tally covered with bushes and trees until its first cleaning in 2016 and 2017 [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:122989", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s008: period_name ''3000 - 1500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:122990", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s008: period_start ''-2000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:122991", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s008: site_type ''City/town/settlement'' -> ''Settlement''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:160062", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-025: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3f/Na-Nova.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/b9609879/Na Nova aèria1.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:252427", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s016: period_name None -> ''3000 - 1500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:252428", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s016: period_start None -> ''-3000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:316518", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-012: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/b9609879/Na Nova aèria1.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/b9609879/Na-Nova.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:351908", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s007: period_name ''3000 - 1500 BC'' -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:351909", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s007: period_start ''-3000'' -> ''-800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:356175", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-24_mechanical-site-type-merge-s003: site_type ''Settlement'' -> ''City/town/settlement''"}]'::jsonb),
