cal historian Beriah Botfield thoroughly excavated and recorded the site [1]. Botfield’s excavations revealed a large range of rooms which ran from north to south, part of which was a bath suite [1]. It was deduced that the buildings were built over a period of time and that the northern rooms are later additions [1]. The earliest parts of the villa were built in the early years of the Roman occupation [1]. The villa consisted of a single storey and was constructed from the local marlstone (sandstone), infilled with rubble [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:106988", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s017: period_name ''1 - 500 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:106989", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s017: period_start ''1'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:160757", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-026: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/bebeb092/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/bebeb092/Borough_Hill_Floor.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:252811", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s017: period_name None -> ''3000 - 1500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:252812", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s017: period_start None -> ''-2500''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:352715", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s008: period_name ''3000 - 1500 BC'' -> ''1 - 500 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:352716", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s008: period_start ''-2500'' -> ''43''"}]'::jsonb),
