t a free-standing building, but had other smaller buildings (such as a forehall, a vestibule and some service buildings) attached to it [1]. The outer courtyard and railings on the first and second stories of the basilica no longer exist, but overall it is remarkably well preserved [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:160788", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-026: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/bfcc8547/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/bfcc8547/2017-06-03 14-26-37 ILCE-6500 DSC02094 DxO Redo PL4 (50786261297).webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:316635", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-012: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/bfcc8547/2017-06-03 14-26-37 ILCE-6500 DSC02094 DxO Redo PL4 (50786261297).webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/bfcc8547/Trier_-_Aula_Palatina.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
