ramework of Intas 2000 programme, European scholars such as Henry de Lumley conducted scientific research in Buzeyir cave in September-October 2002 [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:107893", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s018: period_name ''< 4500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:107894", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s018: period_start ''-70000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:252831", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s017: period_name None -> ''< 4500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:252832", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s017: period_start None -> ''-3000000''"}]'::jsonb),
