Knossos [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:316709", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-012: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/c345810f/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/c345810f/Armon_Knossos_P1060093.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
