ous leaks that were compromising the integrity of the monument, the attic that previously crowned the arch was replaced with a slate roof [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:342329", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "insert-2026-10-07-007-001: thumbnail_url None -> ''/data/images/wiki/c5d05e95/Arco di augusto di sera.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
