 south-west Ireland [1]. The four Castlenalacht stones are arranged in ascending order of height across a distance of 13.4 m [1]. The site is placed on one of the area''s highest hilltops; according to the archaeologist Clive Ruggles, the builders tended to favour locations where the axis, from largest to smallest stone, leads to a relatively distant horizon [1]. The precise functions of these constructions are unknown; most archaeologists assume a ceremonial or ritualistic purpose [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:108010", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s018: period_name ''3000 - 1500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:108011", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s018: period_start ''-2000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:161485", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-027: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/c5d2dfc5/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/c5d2dfc5/Castlenalacht5.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:253189", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s018: period_name None -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:253190", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s018: period_start None -> ''-4000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:352763", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s008: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> ''3000 - 1500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:352764", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s008: period_start ''-4000'' -> ''-2500''"}]'::jsonb),
    ('c5d612d7-5604-4de3-b797-7cbcbdafdde7'::uuid, 'antiquity', '4', '1', 'card-stats-2026-11-05-rollback:c5d612d7-5604-4de3-b797-7cbcbdafdde7:antiquity', 'rollback of card-stats-2026-11-05: antiquity ''1'' restored on Shihsanhang Museum of Archaeology', '74f0cc20b8927bb76bb661df0e5760cd', '[{"source": "api/cardgame/generator.py:site_card_stats", "url": "api/cardgame/generator.py", "quote": "antiquity = 4 from period_start -50"}, {"source": "production export 21200f1e3f26a29a (2026-11-05 22:52:16.465314+00)", "url": "remediation_change_log + unified_sites + card_stats (read-only)", "quote": "counterfactual: 5519 journalled input value(s) put back reproduce the stored card_stats in all 59724 cells (basis: wave 2026-10-04f''s own export (2026-10-04 19:19:41.515456+00))"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:87346", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase4:p4-2169:chunk-0001: description ''An archaeological museum in Bali District, New Taipei, Taiwan, built in 1998 on the excavation site of the Shihsanhang culture dating back 500 to 1,800 years. The site was one of only two communities in Taiwan to master iron smelting, and excavations since 1957 uncovered iron slag, pottery, and burial areas with over 300 skeletons. The ancient inhabitants are believed to be ancestors of the Ketagalan aboriginal people. Discoveries of silver, copperware, gold jewelry, and coins indicate extensive trade networks. The award-winning museum building features a \"Bridge of Time\" exhibit.'' -> ''The Shihsanhang Museum of Archaeology is an archaeological museum in Bali District, New Taipei [1]. The museum conserves and displays artifacts from the Shihsanhang archaeological site [1]. The origins of the museum date back to excavations undertaken at Shihsanhang in 1990 [1]. The Shihsanhang Museum was built in 1998 [1]. The museum is located at the foot of Guanyin Mountain near the mouth of the Tamsui River [1]. The archaeological site dates back 1,800 years to the Iron Age [1]. Over 300 skeletons have been unearthed dating from 1,800 to 600 years old [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:108012", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s018: period_name ''1 - 500 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:108013", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s018: period_start ''1'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:161486", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-027: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e0/%E6%96%B0%E5%8C%97%E5%B8%82%E7%AB%8B%E5%8D%81%E4%B8%89%E8%A1%8C%E5%8D%9A%E7%89%A9%E9%A4%A8FUJI7904.JPG'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/c5d612d7/新北市立十三行博物館FUJI7904.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:242781", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s009: period_name None -> ''1500+ AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:242782", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s009: period_start None -> ''1998''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:352765", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s008: period_name ''1500+ AD'' -> ''500 BC - 1 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:352766", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s008: period_start ''1998'' -> ''-50''"}]'::jsonb),
