r [1]. The archaeological site dates back 1,800 years to the Iron Age [1]. Over 300 skeletons have been unearthed dating from 1,800 to 600 years old [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:108012", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s018: period_name ''1 - 500 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:108013", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s018: period_start ''1'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:161486", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-027: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e0/%E6%96%B0%E5%8C%97%E5%B8%82%E7%AB%8B%E5%8D%81%E4%B8%89%E8%A1%8C%E5%8D%9A%E7%89%A9%E9%A4%A8FUJI7904.JPG'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/c5d612d7/新北市立十三行博物館FUJI7904.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:242781", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s009: period_name None -> ''1500+ AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:242782", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s009: period_start None -> ''1998''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:352765", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s008: period_name ''1500+ AD'' -> ''500 BC - 1 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:352766", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s008: period_start ''1998'' -> ''-50''"}]'::jsonb),
    ('c5f8bd3a-c334-453c-b99b-9509aac6ea90'::uuid, 'antiquity', '5', '4', 'card-stats-2026-11-05-rollback:c5f8bd3a-c334-453c-b99b-9509aac6ea90:antiquity', 'rollback of card-stats-2026-11-05: antiquity ''4'' restored on Scladina', '598eea6ef10318ec2c21105bbc273f93', '[{"source": "api/cardgame/generator.py:site_card_stats", "url": "api/cardgame/generator.py", "quote": "antiquity = 5 from period_start None"}, {"source": "production export 21200f1e3f26a29a (2026-11-05 22:52:16.465314+00)", "url": "remediation_change_log + unified_sites + card_stats (read-only)", "quote": "counterfactual: 5519 journalled input value(s) put back reproduce the stored card_stats in all 59724 cells (basis: wave 2026-10-04f''s own export (2026-10-04 19:19:41.515456+00))"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:45235", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase4:p4-0107:chunk-0001: description \"Scladina (or Sclayn Cave) is a Neanderthal occupation site in the Andenne hills of Belgium, where excavations since 1978 have yielded over 13,000 Mousterian stone tools [1]. The site''s stratified deposits span multiple Ice Age periods, with the remarkable discovery in 1993 of the nearly complete skeleton of a young Neanderthal child, one of the oldest known in western Europe [2]. The cave sits on a hill overlooking the Meuse River near Sclayn [3].\" -> \"Scladina, or Sclayn Cave, is an archaeological site located in Wallonia in the town of Sclayn, in the Andenne hills in Belgium, where excavations since 1978 have provided the material for an exhaustive collection of over thirteen thousand Mousterian stone artifacts and the fossilized remains of an especially ancient Neanderthal, called the Scladina child were discovered in 1993 [1]. The Scladina cave is located on a hill to the right of the Meuse river bank, south-west of Sclayn village, being one of a number of caves in the middle Meuse river region [1]. After the initial clearing of the entrance, the excavations uncovered two strata of Neanderthal occupation, the oldest dating back 130,000 years [1]. Dated to be around 127,000 years old, the first fragment of the now nearly complete mandible was found on 16 July 1993 [1]. The child''s DNA is one of the oldest to have been extracted from a Homo neanderthalensis fossil and has significantly contributed to the genetic mapping of the Neanderthal genome and the comparison with Homo sapiens [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:108018", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s018: period_name ''< 4500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:108019", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s018: period_start ''-127000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:161493", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-027: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/03/Grotte_de_Sclayn_1b.jpg/400px-Grotte_de_Sclayn_1b.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/c5f8bd3a/Grotte Scladina Sclayn Andenne.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:253193", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s018: period_name None -> ''500 BC - 1 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:253194", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s018: period_start None -> ''-500''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:352767", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s008: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:352768", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s008: period_start ''-500'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
