iberrie''s Grave and Shrub''s Wood Long Barrow are found on the eastern side [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:108763", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s019: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:108764", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s019: period_start ''-4000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:162182", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-028: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/cb4e0159/hero.webp'' -> \"/data/images/wiki/cb4e0159/Jacket''s Field Long Barrow (North Face - 01).webp\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:242828", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s009: period_name None -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:242829", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s009: period_start None -> ''-4000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:317496", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-013: thumbnail_url \"/data/images/wiki/cb4e0159/Jacket''s Field Long Barrow (North Face - 01).webp\" -> \"/data/images/wiki/cb4e0159/Jacket''s_Field_Long_Barrow_I.webp\""}]'::jsonb),
    ('cb637b1a-4f1b-4856-815f-67f2424a717f'::uuid, 'mystery', '5', '7', 'card-stats-2026-11-05-rollback:cb637b1a-4f1b-4856-815f-67f2424a717f:mystery', 'rollback of card-stats-2026-11-05: mystery ''7'' restored on Fa''ahia', 'f2ad68a6a2d13c7c12792363ecb3ac1b', '[{"source": "api/cardgame/generator.py:site_card_stats", "url": "api/cardgame/generator.py", "quote": "mystery = 5 from (''City/town/settlement'', ''1000 - 1500 AD'') is shared by 46 curated site(s)"}, {"source": "production export 21200f1e3f26a29a (2026-11-05 22:52:16.465314+00)", "url": "remediation_change_log + unified_sites + card_stats (read-only)", "quote": "counterfactual: 5519 journalled input value(s) put back reproduce the stored card_stats in all 59724 cells (basis: wave 2026-10-04f''s own export (2026-10-04 19:19:41.515456+00))"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:28349", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase3:batch-0116:chunk-0001: site_type ''City/town/settlement'' -> ''Archaeological site''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:36017", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-25_mechanical-journal-reversal-3: site_type ''Archaeological site'' -> ''City/town/settlement''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:87488", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase4:p4-2173:chunk-0001: description \"Fa''ahia is an early Polynesian settlement on the north-east coast of Huahine in the Society Islands, French Polynesia. Dating to between 700 and 1200 CE, it is one of the rare wet sites in Polynesia where waterlogged conditions have preserved numerous organic artefacts including wooden patu hand clubs, canoe parts and adze handles [1].\" -> \"Faʻahia is an early Polynesian occupation site in the north-east of the island of Huahine, in the Society Islands [1]. With the neighbouring Vaitoʻotia site, it dates to between 700 CE and 1200 CE [1]. Because much of the site is waterlogged, artefacts made of organic materials have been well preserved, including wooden patu hand clubs, canoe parts and adze handles [1]. Subfossil bird bones have also been well preserved, providing much new information about the avifauna of the island around the time it was first settled by humans, demonstrating that even small islands could hold a rich variety of bird species [1]. Several excavations were conducted by Yosihiko H. Sinoto of the Bernice P. Bishop Museum [1]. Globally extinct species of land birds found at the site include two rails, the Huahine rail and swamphen; two doves, the great ground dove and Huahine cuckoo-dove; two parrots, the conquered lorikeet and Sinoto''s lorikeet, and the Huahine starling [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:124255", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s009: period_name ''500 - 1000 AD'' -> ''1000 - 1500 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:124256", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s009: period_start ''500'' -> ''1050''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:124257", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s009: site_type ''City/town/settlement'' -> ''Settlement''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:124258", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s009: source_url ''https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fa%27ahia'' -> ''https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fa%CA%BBahia''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:162183", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-028: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/cb637b1a/hero.webp'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:356196", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-24_mechanical-site-type-merge-s003: site_type ''Settlement'' -> ''City/town/settlement''"}]'::jsonb),
