se results were found using one of the earliest uses of flotation technology in archaeobotany [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:108765", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s019: period_name ''< 4500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:108766", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s019: period_start ''-8000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:108767", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s019: site_type ''City/town/settlement'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:242830", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s009: site_type None -> ''Archaeological site''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:253243", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s018: period_name None -> ''3000 - 1500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:253244", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s018: period_start None -> ''-3000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:352805", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s008: lat ''42.61680089201004'' -> ''42.653333''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:352806", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s008: lon ''25.400107285080768'' -> ''24.051604''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:352807", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s008: period_name ''3000 - 1500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:352808", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s008: period_start ''-3000'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
