s now England, sometimes located on hilltops [1]. On Slate Hill there are four concentric ramparts, terraced on the sloping hillside, in a semicircle forming on the north and west sides of an enclosure; quarrying has affected the east side where one rampart remains [1]. The ramparts, of stone and earth, are about 5 metres (16 ft) wide and 1.4 metres (4 ft 7 in) high [1]. On the south side a steep slope provides defence [1]. The enclosure within the defences is about 98 metres west to east and 62 metres north to south [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:124281", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s009: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:124282", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s009: period_start ''-1000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:124283", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s009: site_type ''City/town/settlement'' -> ''Settlement''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:162233", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-028: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/22/Settlement_earthworks_-_geograph.org.uk_-_387809.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/cc7e7e8a/hero.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:253251", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s018: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:253252", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s018: period_start None -> ''-1500''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:356198", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-24_mechanical-site-type-merge-s003: site_type ''Settlement'' -> ''City/town/settlement''"}]'::jsonb),
    ('cc8c8638-cb77-4b61-a248-5c0f8e19cb66'::uuid, 'mystery', '1', '6', 'card-stats-2026-11-05-rollback:cc8c8638-cb77-4b61-a248-5c0f8e19cb66:mystery', 'rollback of card-stats-2026-11-05: mystery ''6'' restored on Dur-Sharrukin', '48980c8123ac49abcd6d6e196733cedd', '[{"source": "api/cardgame/generator.py:site_card_stats", "url": "api/cardgame/generator.py", "quote": "mystery = 1 from (''City/town/settlement'', ''1500 - 500 BC'') is shared by 286 curated site(s)"}, {"source": "production export 21200f1e3f26a29a (2026-11-05 22:52:16.465314+00)", "url": "remediation_change_log + unified_sites + card_stats (read-only)", "quote": "counterfactual: 5519 journalled input value(s) put back reproduce the stored card_stats in all 59724 cells (basis: wave 2026-10-04f''s own export (2026-10-04 19:19:41.515456+00))"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:28075", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase3:batch-0065:chunk-0001: site_type ''Temple complex'' -> ''Settlement''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:87528", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase4:p4-2174:chunk-0001: description \"Dur-Sharrukin, present-day Khorsabad in northern Iraq, served as the Assyrian capital under Sargon II (r. 721–705 BC) [1]. Built within the decade preceding 706 BC, the city served as the imperial seat [1]. Following Sargon''s unexpected death in battle, the capital was moved approximately 20 km south to Nineveh [1].\" -> ''Dur-Sharrukin, present day Khorsabad, was the Assyrian capital in the time of Sargon II of Assyria [1]. The great city was entirely built in the decade preceding 706 BC, when the court moved to Dur-Sharrukin, although it was not completely finished yet [1]. The town was of rectangular layout and measured 1758.6 by 1635 metres [1]. The enclosed area comprised 3 square kilometres [1]. The city walls were massive and 157 towers protected its sides [1]. Seven gates entered the city from all directions [1]. A walled terrace contained temples and the royal palace [1]. The site of Khorsabad was excavated between 1928–1935 by American archaeologists from the Institute for the Study of Ancient Cultures in Chicago [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:162238", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-028: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/cc8c8638/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/cc8c8638/Reconstructed_Model_of_Palace_of_Sargon_at_Khosrabad_1905.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:356199", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-24_mechanical-site-type-merge-s003: site_type ''Settlement'' -> ''City/town/settlement''"}]'::jsonb),
