00 metres north of Failand village [1]. It is an Iron Age settlement with a raised oval interior about 40 metres wide on the long axis [1]. Partial excavations in 1928 found sherds of black burnished pottery and a Kimmeridge shale bracelet, typical of rural settlements in the Iron Age [1]. Minor earthworks mark the homes in the interior, which were surrounded by a bank and ditch [1]. The bank, up to 8 metres wide, was made of earth and small stones over natural rock outcrops [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:108862", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s019: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:108863", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s019: period_start ''-1500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:108864", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s019: site_type ''Earthwork'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:162981", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-029: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3a/Field_edge_boundary_%28geograph_3522458%29.jpg'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:243694", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s010: site_type None -> ''Settlement''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:253629", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s019: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:253630", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s019: period_start None -> ''-1500''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:326138", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-005-003: thumbnail_url None -> ''/data/images/wiki/d138312f/Field edge boundary (geograph 3522458).webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:356207", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-24_mechanical-site-type-merge-s003: s