. The palace was equipped with a semicircular nymphaeum [1]. The excavations were carried out by Amedeo Maiuri starting from 1932 [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:108872", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s019: period_name ''1 - 500 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:108873", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s019: period_start ''1'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:162987", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-029: thumbnail_url None -> ''/data/images/wiki/d1877f2c/hero.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:253631", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s019: period_name None -> ''1000 - 1500 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:253632", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s019: period_start None -> ''1000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:352847", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s008: period_name ''1000 - 1500 AD'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:352848", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s008: period_start ''1000'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
