ild [1]. The tomb is known locally as the \"Giant\\''s Grave\" and was originally built as two single tombs [1]. The south court is two thirds of a circle in shape, while the north court is u-shaped [1]. The northern court contains two post holes that would have held large pillar-stones [1]. The tomb stands in an 82 ft (25m) long rectangular cairn [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:124369", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s009: lat ''54.100050301229096'' -> ''54.057253''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:124370", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s009: lon ''-7.049967816112988'' -> ''-7.018076''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:124371", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s009: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:124372", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s009: period_start ''-4000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:163045", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-029: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/d2ecae04/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/d2ecae04/Cohaw_tomb_entrance.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:253645", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s019: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:253646", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s019: period_start None -> ''-800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:317630", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-013: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/d2ecae04/Cohaw_tomb_entrance.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/d2ecae04/View_towards_road_entrance.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:352865", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s008: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:35286