h-century maps [1]. Since the early modern period its length has been greatly shortened by the expansion of Leicester [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:108922", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s019: period_name ''1 - 500 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:108923", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s019: period_start ''1'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:163066", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-029: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/da/Raw_Dykes_north_end.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/d3da22e7/Raw Dykes viewing enclosure.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:253659", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s019: period_name None -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:253660", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s019: period_start None -> ''-4000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:326160", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-005-003: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/d3da22e7/Raw Dykes viewing enclosure.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/d3da22e7/Raw Dykes north end.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:352877", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s008: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> ''1 - 500 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:352878", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s008: period_start ''-4000'' -> ''43''"}]'::jsonb),
