]. The monument is covered by a cup-marked, single slab and piled with small stones [1]. It is thought that the large, flat stone was the original capstone [1]. During excavation, a crouched inhumation burial was found in the central chamber under a floor of flagstones [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:163765", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-030: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/d99323af/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/d99323af/Corrimony Chambered Cairn 1.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
