 were exported throughout the Empire in specially designed amphorae [1]. The ruins were first identified by the archaeologist António Inácio Marques da Costa in 1907 [1]. However, he provided no detailed information about the site and it was not until 1964 when his unpublished manuscripts were discovered that the nature of the site was officially known [1]. It was only in 1987 that the first archaeological excavation was carried out, by the Museum of Archaeology and Ethnology of Setúbal District, led by Carlos Tavares da Silva [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:109721", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s020: period_name ''1 - 500 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:109722", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s020: period_start ''1'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:163771", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-030: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ab/Creiro1.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/d9d26446/Creiro2.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:243779", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s010: period_name None -> ''500 BC - 1 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:243780", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s010: period_start None -> ''-100''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:326196", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-005-003: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/d9d26446/Creiro2.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/d9d26446/Creiro1.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:353691", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s009: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> ''1 - 500 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:353692", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s009: period_start ''-100'' -> ''51''"}]'::jsonb),
