tected by sea-cliffs on the northern side; on the south side there is a smaller drop to the sea [1]. There is a gap in the peninsula, crossed by a modern bridge where there may have been originally a land-bridge; immediately before this there are three massive banks and ditches [1]. About 600 items of worked stone, over 4,000 shards of pottery, and objects of tin, copper and iron and glass were found [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:125580", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s010: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:125581", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s010: period_start ''-4000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:125582", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s010: site_type ''Fortress/citadel'' -> ''Fort''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:254097", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s020: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:254098", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s020: period_start None -> ''-800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:353704", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s009: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''< 4500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:353705", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s009: period_start ''-800'' -> ''-10000''"}]'::jsonb),
