n internal ditch [1]. It is reported that excavation work took place in 1908, though there is little physical evidence of this as the henge appears to be mostly intact [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:109760", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s020: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:109761", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s020: period_start ''-4500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:254109", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s020: period_name None -> ''3000 - 1500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:254110", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s020: period_start None -> ''-3000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:353716", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s009: period_name ''3000 - 1500 BC'' -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:353717", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s009: period_start ''-3000'' -> ''-800''"}]'::jsonb),
