ans assert that Acinipo was created after the battle of Munda (45 BC), fought between the armies of Julius Caesar and the army of Pompey''s two sons [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:109783", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s020: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:109784", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s020: period_start ''-500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:164320", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-031: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/dc789e55/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/dc789e55/Acinipo roman theatre - panoramio.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:243797", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s010: period_name None -> ''500 BC - 1 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:243798", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s010: period_start None -> ''-45''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:318415", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-014: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/dc789e55/Acinipo roman theatre - panoramio.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/dc789e55/Teatroacinipo.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:345736", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-09a_fields-wd5-s001: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> ''3000 - 1500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:345737", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-09a_fields-wd5-s001: period_start ''-45'' -> ''-3000''"}]'::jsonb),
