]. Finds included pottery, flint chips, stone hammers, mortars and pestles, querns, whorls, shale rings, long-handled bone combs, a whale bone club, a silver fibula, steatite cups and an iron blade [1]. The site was excavated again in 1986 [1]. This showed that the site was occupied in the Bronze Age, before the broch was built [1]. A Bronze Age cist burial with a food vessel was discovered [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:109821", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s020: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:109822", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s020: period_start ''-1500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:164367", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-031: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/dea9db29/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/dea9db29/Scotland Carn Liath Broch 1.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:243808", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s010: period_name None -> ''500 BC - 1 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:243809", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s010: period_start None -> ''-100''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:326231", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-005-003: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/dea9db29/Scotland Carn Liath Broch 1.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/dea9db29/Scotland Carn Liath Broch 3.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
