y marks in a land grant of Edmund the Elder, as being the place where the three parishes of Badby, Dodford and Everdon meet [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:125626", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s010: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:125627", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s010: period_start ''-1500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:125628", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s010: site_type ''Fortress/citadel'' -> ''Fort''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:125629", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s010: source_url ''https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Arbury_Hill'' -> ''https://her.northamptonshire.gov.uk/Monument/MNN329''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:164376", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-031: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/df418ae4/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/df418ae4/Arbury_Hill_from_the_south_17th_April_2008_(1).webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:254145", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s020: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:254146", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s020: period_start None -> ''-800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:326239", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-005-003: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/df418ae4/Arbury_Hill_from_the_south_17th_April_2008_(1).webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/df418ae4/Arbury Hill, Northamptonshire 17th April 2008 (1).webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:353746", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s009: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:353747", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s009: period_sta