"remediation_change_log:110519", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s021: period_name ''1 - 500 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:110520", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s021: period_start ''1'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:164475", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-031: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/24/Uley_Old_Crown_and_Church_%282%29.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/e1548be0/Uley_Old_Crown_and_Church_(2).webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:254161", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s020: period_name None -> ''1 - 500 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:254162", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s020: period_start None -> ''1''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:353752", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s009: period_name ''1 - 500 AD'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:353753", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s009: period_start ''1'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
    ('e17ba5d6-296f-4441-85cb-8bff98ef2f7e'::uuid, 'antiquity', '10', '4', 'card-stats-2026-11-05-rollback:e17ba5d6-296f-4441-85cb-8bff98ef2f7e:antiquity', 'rollback of card-stats-2026-11-05: antiquity ''4'' restored on Roca dels Bous - Archaeological Site', '942b07fa762c96c82327d4c584ab453b', '[{"source": "api/cardgame/generator.py:site_card_stats", "url": "api/cardgame/generator.py", "quote": "antiquity = 10 from period_start -48050"}, {"source": "production export 21200f1e3f26a29a (2026-11-05 22:52:16.465314+00)", "url": "remediation_change_log + unified_sites + card_stats (read-only)", "quote": "counterfactual: 5519 journalled input value(s) put back reproduce the stored card_stats in all 59724 cells (basis: wave 2026-10-04f''s own export (2026-10-04 19:19:41.515456+00))"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:29211", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase3:batch-0255:chunk-0001: site_type ''City/town/settlement'' -> ''Archaeological site''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:88020", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase4:p4-2188:chunk-0001: description \"Located in Sant Llorenç de Montgai in the Catalan Pyrenees, Spain, Roca dels Bous is a Middle Paleolithic archaeological site where Neanderthals lived approximately 50,000 years ago [1]. Since 1988, researchers from the Autonomous University of Barcelona and UCL Institute of Archaeology have studied the fossil sequence of southern European Neanderthals using a worldwide unique digital system and innovative technologies [1]. It ranks among Spain''s first Paleolithic excavation sites to establish a visitor centre showcasing Prehistory research of the prepyrenees area [1].\" -> ''Roca dels Bous is an archaeological site located in Sant Llorenç de Montgai, in the Catalan Pyrenees, Spain [1]. Since 1988 the Autonomous University of Barcelona and the UCL Institute of Archaeology study and record the fossil sequence of southern European Neanderthals who inhabited the area during the Middle Paleolithic approximately 50,000 years ago [1]. The site was declared a Cultural Asset of National Interest in 2015 [1]. The site is located 6 mi north of the city of Balaguer, Province of Lleida in northeast Spain, above the river Segre at a height of 286 m in the Pyrenees foothills [1]. Excavation probes yielded especially flint and quartzite artifacts typical of Middle Paleolithic Neanderthals [1]. In the excavation sequence, that reached a depth of 1.5 m, bones from various animals of different ecosystems that were part of the diet of Neanderthal groups were found [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:110521", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s021: period_name ''< 4500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:110522", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s021: period_start ''-48000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:164477", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-031: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c4/Roca_desl_Bous.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/e17ba5d6/hero.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:254163", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s020: period_name None -> ''500 BC - 1 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:254164", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s020: period_start None -> ''-500''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:353754", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s009: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> ''< 4500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:353755", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s009: period_start ''-500'' -> ''-48050''"}]'::jsonb),
