iewed in the local history museum in the fortress at Kufstein [1]. That dating makes the Tischofer Cave the oldest known uncontested site of human occupation in Tyrol [1]. Discoveries of more recent human skeletons and associated tools also indicate that the cave served as a copper smithy and foundry during the Bronze Age [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:110557", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s021: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:110558", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s021: period_start ''-500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:164526", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-031: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b2/WAF-Exkursion_Vorderkaiserfelden_16.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/e355bfda/Tischoferhöhle I.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:254181", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s020: period_name None -> ''500 BC - 1 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:254182", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s020: period_start None -> ''-500''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:318543", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-014: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/e355bfda/Tischoferhöhle I.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/e355bfda/WAF-Exkursion_Vorderkaiserfelden_16.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:353765", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s009: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:353766", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s009: period_start ''-500'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
