: "remediation_change_log:125699", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s010: site_type ''Ruin'' -> ''Archaeological site''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:165058", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-032: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0d/Piletas_Parque_Smith_Algeciras_%282%29.JPG'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/e578e7e9/Piletas_Parque_Smith_Algeciras_(2).webp''"}]'::jsonb),
