plication was made on the basis that it was the best accessible exposure to Lower Greensand and Gault in the Leighton Buzzard area [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:125758", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s010: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:125759", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s010: period_start ''-500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:254593", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s021: period_name None -> ''500 BC - 1 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:254594", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s021: period_start None -> ''-500''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:326393", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-005-003: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/e8d4bfaa/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/e8d4bfaa/Double Arches Pit.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:353802", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s009: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> ''1 - 500 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:353803", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s009: period_start ''-500'' -> ''43''"}]'::jsonb),
