scovered during construction of apartment blocks but the builders tried to destroy it as a hindrance to their work [1]. The Apolline Project identified the site and from 2005 it was cleared and annual excavations started [1]. 10 rooms of baths with massive structures have been discovered on two floors [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:110668", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s021: period_name ''3000 - 1500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:110669", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s021: period_start ''-3000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:165219", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-032: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/06/Scavi_-_Pollena_Trocchia_-_2014_-_03.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/e8ef0cd6/Scavi - Pollena Trocchia - 2014 - 01.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:254595", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s021: period_name None -> ''3000 - 1500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:254596", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s021: period_start None -> ''-3000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:319247", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-015: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/e8ef0cd6/Scavi - Pollena Trocchia - 2014 - 01.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/e8ef0cd6/Scavi_-_Pollena_Trocchia_-_2014_-_03.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:353804", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s009: period_name ''3000 - 1500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:353805", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s009: period_start ''-3000'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
