r the Nakhchivan necropolis [1]. It was discovered by accident during construction in 1970 [1]. The monument with an area of 1.9 hectares consists of six destroyed tombs [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:111371", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s022: period_name ''3000 - 1500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:111372", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s022: period_start ''-2000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:111373", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s022: site_type ''Necropolis/tombs complex'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:244712", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s011: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:244713", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s011: period_start None -> ''-1500''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:244714", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s011: site_type None -> ''Necropolis''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:356241", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-24_mechanical-site-type-merge-s003: site_type ''Necropolis'' -> ''Necropolis/tombs complex''"}]'::jsonb),
    ('ebadc068-2bac-468f-9b3c-df5c12bf446f'::uuid, 'antiquity', '7', '8', 'card-stats-2026-11-05-rollback:ebadc068-2bac-468f-9b3c-df5c12bf446f:antiquity', 'rollback of card-stats-2026-11-05: antiquity ''8'' restored on Sigwells', 'bd368b73b3359ab991cfce62505270ba', '[{"source": "api/cardgame/generator.py:site_card_stats", "url": "api/cardgame/generator.py", "quote": "antiquity = 7 from period_start -2500"}, {"source": "production export 21200f1e3f26a29a (2026-11-05 22:52:16.465314+00)", "url": "remediation_change_log + unified_sites + card_stats (read-only)", "quote": "counterfactual: 5519 journalled input value(s) put back reproduce the stored card_stats in all 59724 cells (basis: wave 2026-10-04f''s own export (2026-10-04 19:19:41.515456+00))"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:81424", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase4:p4-2032:chunk-0001: description ''Sigwells is a hamlet on a rural plateau overlooking Cadbury Castle hillfort in Somerset, England, rich in archaeological remains spanning from the Bronze Age to the early medieval period. Investigated by the South Cadbury Environs Project, the site yielded a Middle Bronze Age metalworking building dated to the 12th century BC, the earliest known such structure in Britain. Iron Age findings include an extensive patchwork of ditch-bounded paddocks, a double-ditched trackway, roundhouses, and enclosures containing animal and human burials alongside metalwork deposits. The site has been designated a Scheduled Ancient Monument.'' -> ''Sigwells, a rural plateau overlooking the Somerset hill fort, Cadbury Castle, was the site of early excavations by one of the fathers of modern archaeology, General Augustus Pitt Rivers, in 1877 [1]. The most important discovery was the earliest known bronze casting building and associated enclosure in Britain [1]. Pitt Rivers excavated two over lapping Early Bronze Age round barrows and a single round barrow [1]. Part of the floor of a circular building in the north of the enclosure was heavily burnt and shallow scoops on the periphery of the building contained mould fragments from objects of what had been regarded as the later Bronze Age Wilburton metalworking tradition [1]. Most notable of the fragments were those subsequently refitted to a sword in the Museum of Somerset [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:111374", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s022: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:111375", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s022: period_start ''-4500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:254621", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s021: period_name None -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:254622", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s021: period_start None -> ''-4500''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:353823", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s009: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> ''3000 - 1500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:353824", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s009: period_start ''-4500'' -> ''-2500''"}]'::jsonb),
