ategic position [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:84282", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26a_fields-wd1-s001: site_type ''City/town/settlement'' -> ''Fort''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:165759", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-033: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a2/Castleford_Legions_-_geograph.org.uk_-_393608.jpg'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
    ('ec838509-a1e6-4f6a-b216-3f1791c16d67'::uuid, 'mystery', '6', '5', 'card-stats-2026-11-05-rollback:ec838509-a1e6-4f6a-b216-3f1791c16d67:mystery', 'rollback of card-stats-2026-11-05: mystery ''5'' restored on Legananny Dolmen', 'd28e0e89da927adfc2febed6027d5239', '[{"source": "api/cardgame/generator.py:site_card_stats", "url": "api/cardgame/generator.py", "quote": "mystery = 6 from (''Dolmen'', ''3000 - 1500 BC'') is shared by 22 curated site(s)"}, {"source": "production export 21200f1e3f26a29a (2026-11-05 22:52:16.465314+00)", "url": "remediation_change_log + unified_sites + card_stats (read-only)", "quote": "counterfactual: 5519 journalled input value(s) put back reproduce the stored card_stats in all 59724 cells (basis: wave 2026-10-04f''s own export (2026-10-04 19:19:41.515456+00))"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:28787", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase3:batch-0194:chunk-0001: period_start ''-4500'' -> ''-3000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:30533", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-22_mechanical-period-name: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> ''3000 - 1500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:30808", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-22_mechanical-uk-parts: country ''Ireland'' -> ''Northern Ireland''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:36075", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-25_mechanical-journal-reversal-3: period_name ''3000 - 1500 BC'' -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:36076", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-25_mechanical-journal-reversal-3: period_start ''-3000'' -> ''-4500''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:43121", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase4:p4-0066:chunk-0001: description ''A Neolithic portal tomb on the slopes of Slieve Croob in County Down, Northern Ireland, approximately 4,500 years old. Its coffin-shaped capstone, over 3 meters long, is balanced on three upright stones reaching up to 2 meters high, giving it a distinctive tripod form likened to a coffin held high by pallbearers. Reports indicate an urn was found in the chamber beneath the tomb, and boulders under the grass suggest a cairn once covered the structure. A State Care Historic Monument, it is one of the most photographed megalithic sites in Ireland.'' -> ''The Legananny Dolmen is a megalithic dolmen or cromlech nine miles southeast of Banbridge and three miles north of Castlewellan, both in County Down, Northern Ireland [1]. It is on the slopes of Slieve Croob near the village of Leitrim in Drumgooland parish [1]. It is a State Care Historic Monument sited in the townland of Legananny, in Banbridge District [1]. This tripod dolmen has a capstone over 3 m long and 1.8 m from the ground [1]. It dates to the Neolithic period, making the monument around 5,000 years old [1]. Such portal tombs were funerary sites for the disposal of the dead in Neolithic society [1]. The three supporting stones are unusually long and there are slight traces of a cairn which must have been far more extensive [1]. Some urns were found underneath [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:125780", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s010: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> ''3000 - 1500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:125781", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s010: period_start ''-4500'' -> ''-3000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:165761", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-033: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/ec838509/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/ec838509/County Down - Legananny Dolmen 20230302 2.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:319300", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-015: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/ec838509/County Down - Legananny Dolmen 20230302 2.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/ec838509/Legananny_Dolmen_(08),_December_2009.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
