", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s022: period_start ''-1500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:165876", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-033: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ab/View_north_from_Woodbury_Hill_-_geograph.org.uk_-_418941.jpg'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:254659", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s021: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:254660", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s021: period_start None -> ''-800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:335310", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-009-003: thumbnail_url None -> ''/data/images/wiki/f0b4765f/hero.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
    ('f0b786ae-17e0-4ce1-bfdc-c9184e5473a3'::uuid, 'mystery', '3', '4', 'card-stats-2026-11-05-rollback:f0b786ae-17e0-4ce1-bfdc-c9184e5473a3:mystery', 'rollback of card-stats-2026-11-05: mystery ''4'' restored on Hohlenstein-Stadel', 'b29bc74e54f48cf3b4b926916a94a6b0', '[{"source": "api/cardgame/generator.py:site_card_stats", "url": "api/cardgame/generator.py", "quote": "mystery = 3 from (''Cave Structures'', ''< 4500 BC'') is shared by 113 curated site(s)"}, {"source": "production export 21200f1e3f26a29a (2026-11-05 22:52:16.465314+00)", "url": "remediation_change_log + unified_sites + card_stats (read-only)", "quote": "counterfactual: 5519 journalled input value(s) put back reproduce the stored card_stats in all 59724 cells (basis: wave 2026-10-04f''s own export (2026-10-04 19:19:41.515456+00))"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:43691", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase4:p4-0080:chunk-0001: description ''Hohlenstein-Stadel is a cave in the Lonetal valley of the Swabian Jura, Germany, renowned as the discovery site of the Lowenmensch (Lion-Man), a mammoth ivory figurine dated to 35,000-41,000 years ago -- one of the oldest known pieces of figurative art. The sculpture was found on 25 August 1939 by geologist Otto Volzing during excavations led by Robert Wetzel, but World War II delayed analysis for decades. Archaeologist Joachim Hahn first reassembled over 200 fragments in the 1960s, and a major restoration in 2012-2013 incorporated newly discovered pieces. The figurine was found in a chamber 30 metres from the cave entrance alongside bone tools, worked antlers, and jewellery, suggesting possible ritual use of the space.'' -> ''Hohlenstein-Stadel is a cave located in the Hohlenstein cliff (not to be confused with the Hohle Fels) at the southern rim of the Lonetal in the Swabian Jura in Germany [1]. The most significant finding was a small ivory statue called the Löwenmensch, which is one of the oldest pieces of figurative art ever found [1]. The first excavations at Hohlenstein were made in 1861 by Oskar Fraas, geologist and paleontologist [1]. On 27 August 1937, excavators discovered the right femur diaphysis, measuring around 25 cm in length, of an archaic hominin in the cave [1]. The femur came from a layer associated with Middle Paleolithic Mousterian artefacts [1]. In 2017, researchers successfully sequenced the full mtDNA genome from the femur [1]. The results confirmed that the femur belonged to a Neanderthal [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:111468", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s022: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:111469", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s022: period_start ''-4500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:165879", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-033: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/f0b786ae/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/f0b786ae/Blick nach außen Hohlenstein-Stadel, Asselfingen, Lonetal.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:254661", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s021: period_name None -> ''< 4500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:254662", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s021: period_start None -> ''-4501''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:335313", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-009-003: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/f0b786ae/Blick nach außen Hohlenstein-Stadel, Asselfingen, Lonetal.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/f0b786ae/Höhle_Hohlenstein_Hohlensteinstadel.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
