e of a small quarry [1]. The most impressive hypogeum is adorned with two decorated pillars, an agape table and two baldacchino tombs [1]. The window tombs that surround the agape table suggest that it was an important feature of the catacomb [1]. At least two of the window tombs are lavishly decorated with reliefs depicting palm fronds and other spiraled patterns [1]. The palm fronds, together with a number of incised crosses, are proof of the Christian origins of the burial site [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:111476", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s022: period_name ''1 - 500 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:111477", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s022: period_start ''1'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:165899", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-033: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/74/Salina_tomb.JPG'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/f10115c4/Malta - Naxxar - Triq il-Katakombi - Salina Catacombs 01 ies.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:254665", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s021: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:254666", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s021: period_start None -> ''-800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:319389", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-015: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/f10115c4/Malta - Naxxar - Triq il-Katakombi - Salina Catacombs 01 ies.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/f10115c4/Salina_tomb.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:353855", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s009: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:353856", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s009: period_start ''-800'' -> None"}