to a temporary Bronze Age settlement (1800-500 BC), by people who visited the island for seasonal hunting and fishing [1]. The first permanent settlement on the island dates back to the late Germanic Iron Age (400-800 AD) [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:126622", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s011: lat ''59.32493242451594'' -> ''59.33611''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:126623", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s011: lon ''17.56002754189365'' -> ''17.54528''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:126624", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s011: period_name ''3000 - 1500 BC'' -> ''500 - 1000 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:126625", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s011: period_start ''-3000'' -> ''750''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:126626", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s011: site_type ''Mound/tumulus'' -> ''Town''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:126627", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s011: source_url ''https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bj%C3%B6rk%C3%B6_(Eker%C3%B6)'' -> ''https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Birka''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:166510", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-034: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/f3c2a268/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/f3c2a268/Birka Vikingabegravningar.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:333144", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-006-002: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/f3c2a268/Birka Vikingabegravningar.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/f3c2a268/Birka Boot 2008.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:356248", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-24_mechanical-site-type-merge-s003: site_type ''Town'' -> ''City/town/settlement''"}]'::jsonb),
