tle proper rests within the earthwork rings [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:126635", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s011: period_name ''3000 - 1500 BC'' -> ''1000 - 1500 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:126636", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s011: period_start ''-3000'' -> ''1101''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:166600", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-034: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/f5e7956b/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/f5e7956b/Llansteffan Castle Llansteffan.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:319476", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-015: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/f5e7956b/Llansteffan Castle Llansteffan.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/f5e7956b/Llansteffan_Castle.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
