e not recognized until 1950 when the old quarry was reopened [1]. Archaeological and speleological excavations started in 1953, headed by the archaeologist Branko Gavela and young speleologist Radenko Lazarević [1]. Worked flint tools and bone artifacts of prehistoric human origin were discovered in sediments in a depth of 1 to 1.75 m [1]. These artifact assemblages are attributed to Neanderthal occupants during the end of the Middle Paleolithic period [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:112221", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s023: period_name ''< 4500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:112222", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s023: period_start ''-50000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:166608", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-034: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/ff/Ulaz_u_pecinu_risovaca.jpg/400px-Ulaz_u_pecinu_risovaca.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/f6916087/Pećina Risovača, Risovaca Cave - panoramio.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:255039", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s022: period_name None -> ''500 BC - 1 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:255040", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s022: period_start None -> ''-500''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:354423", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s010: lat ''44.30014586334488'' -> ''44.303308''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:354424", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s010: lon ''20.56643181215441'' -> ''20.581952''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:354425", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s010: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:354426", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_f