the Musee des Antiquites Nationales, St. Germain-en-Laye and the British Museum [1]. The Abri de la Madeleine is classified as a Monument historique since 1956 [1]. In 1979, the Abri de la Madeleine was inscribed on the UNESCO World Heritage List as part of the Prehistoric Sites and Decorated Caves of the Vézère Valley because of its unique paleolithic artwork and archeological importance [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:112227", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s023: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:112228", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s023: period_start ''-500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:166612", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-034: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/f6b8fa8a/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/f6b8fa8a/Abri de la Madeleine - Vue générale - 20090925.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:255043", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s022: period_name None -> ''500 BC - 1 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:255044", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s022: period_start None -> ''-500''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:319487", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-015: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/f6b8fa8a/Abri de la Madeleine - Vue générale - 20090925.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/f6b8fa8a/F07_0051.Ma.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:354427", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s010: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> ''< 4500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:354428", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s010: period_start ''-500'' -> ''-50000''"}]'::jsonb),
