d in importance to the extent that it was not included among the thirty Cretan cities that signed a pact with the Attalid king of Pergamum, Eumenes II, in 183 BCE [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:126647", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s011: site_type ''Archaeological site'' -> ''City''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:166616", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-034: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/f70384d7/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/f70384d7/Dreros 06.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:326513", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-005-003: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/f70384d7/Dreros 06.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/f70384d7/Dreros 12.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:356359", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-24_mechanical-site-type-merge-s004: site_type ''City'' -> ''City/town/settlement''"}]'::jsonb),
