oth in line with each other, with each tomb having its own court [1]. It is estimated that when it was built Gartnanoul was 28 metres long and 8 metres wide [1]. The roof stones are missing although the tomb is in good condition and cairn materials are found scattered around the tomb [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:112319", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s023: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:112320", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s023: period_start ''-4000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:167312", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-035: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/fb877d92/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/fb877d92/Gartnanoul_Court_Tomb-1.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:255083", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s022: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:255084", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s022: period_start None -> ''-800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:354463", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s010: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:354464", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s010: period_start ''-800'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
