here are no visible traces of occupation inside [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:112326", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s023: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:112327", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s023: period_start ''-500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:255087", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s022: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:255088", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s022: period_start None -> ''-800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:320042", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-016: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/fc247379/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/fc247379/Lesingey Round - geograph.org.uk - 1417153.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:354467", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s010: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:354468", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s010: period_start ''-800'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
