idence showing that the presence of Neanderthals and modern humans overlapped in Europe for a significant period [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:126693", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s011: lat ''36.966820971360114'' -> ''36.950732''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:126694", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s011: lon ''-4.1333333035552275'' -> ''-4.127058''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:126695", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s011: period_name ''< 4500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:126696", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s011: period_start ''-28000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:167320", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-035: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/10/Iglesia_de_la_Inmaculada_Concepción,_en_Zafarraya_(Granada).jpg/400px-Iglesia_de_la_Inmaculada_Concepción,_en_Zafarraya_(Granada).jpg'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:255089", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s022: period_name None -> ''500 BC - 1 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:255090", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s022: period_start None -> ''-500''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:354469", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s010: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> ''< 4500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:354470", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s010: period_start ''-500'' -> ''-48050''"}]'::jsonb),
