algh identified a seventh stone and drew attention to the destruction of the site [1]. A saddle quern was found in 1954 and the site was scheduled in 1958 [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:112338", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s023: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:112339", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s023: period_start ''-4500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:167367", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-035: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/fc9edb4c/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/fc9edb4c/Not the most impressive of stone circles - geograph.org.uk - 2385288.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:245182", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s012: period_name None -> ''3000 - 1500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:245183", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s012: period_start None -> ''-2100''"}]'::jsonb),
