 In 1977 the mound was reported to have received some damage during 20th century forestry activity, and received a partial excavation around this time, which confirmed its size, but revealed neither any burials nor any other finds [1]. The cairn is a Scheduled Monument [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:112386", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s023: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:112387", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s023: period_start ''-4500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:255261", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s023: period_name None -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:255262", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s023: period_start None -> ''-4000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:344084", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "insert-2026-10-07-010-001: thumbnail_url None -> ''/data/images/wiki/fee01523/Y Foel Chwern - geograph.org.uk - 6494728.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:354499", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s010: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> ''3000 - 1500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:354500", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s010: period_start ''-4000'' -> ''-2300''"}]'::jsonb),
