in the vicinity of Maleme [1]. The tholos tomb, located on \"Kafkala\" hill, was accidentally revealed and then looted at the beginning of the 20th century [1]. During World War II a bomb caused the partial destruction of its roof and the backfill of the chamber [1]. It is a significant funerary monument excavated in 1966 by the curator Mr. C. Davaras and partly restored in 1970 [1]. A corridor (\"dromos\"), 25.10m long and 1.60m wide, leads to the chamber [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:126726", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s011: lat ''35.522405546418014'' -> ''35.5236''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:126727", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s011: lon ''23.847532182886788'' -> ''23.8327''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:126728", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s011: period_name ''3000 - 1500 BC'' -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:126729", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s011: period_start ''-3000'' -> ''-1300''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:126730", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s011: site_type ''Necropolis/tombs complex'' -> ''Tomb''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:126731", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s011: source_url ''https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Maleme'' -> ''http://odysseus.culture.gr/h/2/gh251.jsp?obj_id=15961''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:167499", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-035: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/ff53d37c/hero.webp'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:342974", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "insert-2026-10-07-008-001: thumbnail_url None -> ''/data/images/wiki/ff53d37c/Tholos tomb of Maleme 09.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
