eters [1]. It was excavated by the archaeologist Martín Almagro Basch in 1935 and 1936, finding stone axes, flint tools, and skeletal remains of various individuals [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:167525", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-035: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/ff70aa7e/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/ff70aa7e/PPA2719 Rodellar, dolmen de la Losa Mora, despoblado de Otín y Mascún inferior.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:320108", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-016: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/ff70aa7e/PPA2719 Rodellar, dolmen de la Losa Mora, despoblado de Otín y Mascún inferior.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/ff70aa7e/Dolmen_de_la_Losa_Mora_(desde_el_oeste).webp''"}]'::jsonb),
